<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luke</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="mt">Luke</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kha thil kan zînga lo thleng, a tîr ata a hmutute leh thu rawngbâwltuten keimahni min hrilh ang khân, mi tam takin ziak an tum ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chuvângin, Theophil ṭha ber, a bul ata engkim fel takin ka chhui a, indawt zêlin i tân ziak ila a ṭha ang, ka ti a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hmâna thu an zirtîr che kha dik tak a ni tih i hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai ram lal Heroda a dam laiin, Abija pâwla mi a hming Zakaria, puithiam pakhat a awm a; chu mi chuan Arona thlah zînga mi nupuiah a nei a, a hming chu Elizabeti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An pahnihin Pathian mit hmuhin fel takin an awm a, sawisêl bovin, Lalpa thupêk leh a dân zawng zawng zâwmin an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Elizabeti a chin avângin fa an nei lo, an pahnihin upa tak an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a pâwlte tih dân ang zêla Pathian hmaa puithiama a chêt laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />puithiam dân angin Lalpa biak ina luh leh englo rimtui hâl a chang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, englo rimtui hâl hun laiin mipui chu an zain pâwnah an ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh pakhat, englo rimtui hâlna maichâm ding lama dingin a hnênah a inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Zakarian a hmuh veleh a mangang a, hlauh pawh a hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “Zakari, hlau suh, i dîl kha a hria asin, i nupui Elizabetin fapa a hrinsak ang che, a hmingah Johana i sa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, nang i hlimin i lâwm ang a; amah a pianin mi tam tak an lâwm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa ngaihin mi lian a ni ang a, uain leh zu rêng reng a in lo vang; a nu pum chhûng aṭang rêngin Thlarau Thianghlimin a lo khat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israela thlahte tam tak Lalpa an Pathian hnên lamah a hawitîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, pate thinlung chu fate lama hawitîr tûr te, mi tihmawhte chu mi fel tak finna lama hawitîr tûr te, Lalpa tâna mi lo inpeih tûr tea buatsaih tûrin, Elija rilru leh a thiltihtheihna puin Lalpa hmaah a kal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Zakarian vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “Chu chu engtin nge ka hriat ang? Kei putar ka ni a, ka nupui pawh pitar a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Gabriela, Pathian hmaa ding ṭhîn ka ni a; a be tûr che leh, chûng thu ṭha chu hrilh tûr chein rawn tirh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai rawh, ka thusawite a hun taka lo thleng tûr chu i âwih loh avângin, chûng thil chu a lo thlen hma loh zawng i ngawi reng ang a, ṭawng pawh i ṭawng thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, vântlângho chuan Zakaria chu an lo nghâk a, Pathian biak in chhûnga a awm rei avâng chuan mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a lo chhuah chuan an hnênah thu a sawi thei ta lo va; tichuan, biak inah thlarau inlâr a hmu a ni tih an hre ta a; tin, an hnênah a zaizir fo va, ṭawng thei lovin a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a rawngbâwlna hun ni bi chu a kim veleh a inah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan a nupui Elizabeti chu a lo rai ta a, “Mi hnêna ka hmingchhia chhilh nân Lalpan duhsak takin heti hian mi tihsak ta,” tiin thla nga a biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a thla ruknaah chuan Pathianin vântirhkoh Gabriela chu Galili rama khaw pakhat, Nazareth an tihah chuan nula thianghlim pakhat hnênah a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />chu nula chu, Davida thlaha mi Josefa nupui hual a ni a; a hming chu Mari a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chu a hnênah a lût a, “Chibai, voh bîk! Lalpa i hnênah a awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chumi thu avâng chuan a mangang ta êm êm a, “Engtiziaa chibai mi bûk nge ni ang?” tiin a inngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan a hnênah, “Mari, hlau suh; Pathian ngaihsak zâwng i ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai rawh, i rai ang a, fapa i hring ang a, a hmingah chuan Isua i sa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu mi lian a la ni ang a, Chungnungbera Fapa an la ti ang; Lalpa Pathianin a hnênah a thlahtu Davida lalṭhutphah chu a pe ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakoba thlahte chungah chatuanin a lal ang a, a ramin kin ni a nei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Marin vântirhkoh hnênah chuan, “Chûng chu engtin nge ni ang? Mipa ka nei si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Thlarau Thianghlim i chungah a lo thleng ang a, Chungnungbera thiltihtheihnain a hliahkhuh ang che; chuvângin, mi thianghlim lo piang tûr pawh chu Pathian Fapa an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, i laichînnu Elizabeti pawhin a tar hnuin mipa a pai ta; a ching an tih ṭhin kha, tûn thla hi a thla rukna a ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathian thuchhuak rêng rêng thiltithei lovin a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Marin “Ngai teh, Lalpa bâwihnu ka ni, i thu ang zêlin ka chungah thleng rawh se,” a ti a. Tin, vântirhkoh chuan a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Mari chu a tho va, thingtlângah, Judai rama khaw pakhatah chuan a kal ta thuai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tin, Zakaria inah a lût a, Elizabeti chu chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Elizabetin Mari chibai bûk chu a hriat veleh, a pum chhûnga nautê chu a chê a; tin, Elizabeti chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a lo khat ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tin, aw ring takin a au va, “Nang chu hmeichhia azawnga engthâwl i ni, i rîla rah pawh a engthâwl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka Lalpa nu, ka hnêna i lo kal hi eng tizia nge ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai teh, i chibai bûk thâwm ka benga a luh veleh, a lâwm avângin nautê ka pum chhûngah a che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A ring nu pawh a eng a thâwl a ni, a hnêna Lalpan thu a sawi kha a thleng dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Marin, “Ka nunin Lalpa a chawimawi e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka thlarau pawh mi chhandamtu Pathian chungah a lâwm ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A bâwihnu hnam tlâwmzia a hmu a, a khawngaih a; Ngai rawh, tûn achinah ṭhangthar zawng zawngin nihlawh mi ti dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Mi chak khân ka chungah thil ropui tak mi tihsak a, A hming pawh a thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A ṭihtute chu ṭhangthar thlengin a khawngaih zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A bânin a tha chakzia a entîr a, Mi chapote chu an inngaihtuahnain a tidarh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />An ṭhutphaha lal ṭhute chu a hnûk thla a, Hnam tlâwmte chu a chawimawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Rilṭâmte chu thil ṭha takin a tipuar a, Hausate chu kut ruakin a kal botîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Kan thlahtute hnêna a sawi ang khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Abrahama leh a thlahte chu chatuana a khawngaih tûrzia hriat reng nân, A chhiahhlawh Israel-te chu a chhawmdâwl ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, Mari chu thla thum lai a hnênah a awm a; tin, a in lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, Elizabeti nau hrin chu a lo hun ta a; tichuan, fapa a rawn hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tin, a vêngte leh a laichînte chuan Lalpan a khawngaih êm êm tih an lo hria a, an lâwmpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a ni riat nîah chuan nausên serhtan tûrin an lo kal a; a hmingah a pa hming vêk Zakaria bawk sak an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tin, a nuin, “Ni lo ve, ani zawng Johana sak zâwk tûr a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, annin a hnênah, “I laichînte zîngah he hming pu hi tu mah an awm hlei nêm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, a pa hnênah chuan zaizirin, “A hmingah eng nge sa ila i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin, lehkha ziakna phêk a dîl a, “A hming Johana a ni e,” tiin a ziak a. Tin, an zain mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tin, chawplehchilhin a kâ leh a lei chu a lo inphelh a, Pathian fakin a lo ṭawng chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tin, an vêla awm zawng zawng chuan an hlau ta a. Tin, chûng thu chu Judai ram thingtlâng zawng zawngah a thang vêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tin, a hria apiangin an rilruah lungkhamah an nei a, “Chu nausên chu engtin tak la awm ang maw?” an ti a; Lalpa kutin amah a ṭanpui si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tin, a pa Zakaria chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a lo khat a, a sawi lâwk a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Lalpa, Israela Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se, A mite chu a rawn tlawh a, tlanna a siamsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Davida chhûngte zîngah chuan, Chhandamna ropui tak min siamsak ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />(Leilung pian tirh ata a zâwlnei thianghlimte kâa a sawi ang khân)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Kan dote lakah leh min hawtute zawng zawng laka chhandamna chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Kan thlahtute khawngaih nân leh, A thuthlung thianghlim hriat reng nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Kan thlahtu Abrahama hnênah chhia a chham kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Kan dote lakah kan hima, Kan dam chhûng zawng a mit hmuha thianghlim leh fel taka awma, Hlau lova a rawng min bâwltîr tûr thu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />“A ni, Taitê, nang hi Chungnungbera zâwlnei an ti ang che; A kawngte siam tûrin Lalpa hmaah i kal dâwn si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Kan Pathian thinlunga khawngaihna avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />An sualte ngaihdam nân, A mite hnênah chhandamna thu hriattîr tûrin. Chumi avâng chuan chung lam aṭangin ni chhuakin min rawn tlawh ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Thim zîngah leh thihna hlima ṭhute ên tûr leh Thlamuanna kawnga kan ke pêntîr tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Tin, nausên chu a lo ṭhang lian deuh deuh va, a rilru lam a lo nghet ta telh telh a, Israel-te hnêna a rawn inlâr hma loh zawng thlalêrah a awm reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan heti hi a ni a, Kaisara Augustan khawvêl zawng zawng hming ziak tûr thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu chu Suria rama Kurinia chu ram awptu a nih laia hming ziak hmasa ber chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawng chu an hming ziak tûrin anmahni khua ṭheuhvah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Josefa pawh, Davida chhûngte leh a thlah a nih avângin, Galili rama Nazareth khua aṭangin Mari, a nupui hual, rai ṭeuh chung nên chuan hming ziak tûrin, Judai rama Davida khua Bethlehem an tihah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chuta an awm lai chuan a hrin a lo hun ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a fa tîrah mipa a hring a; puanin a tuam a, khual bûka an len ve tâk loh avângin ran chaw pêkna thlêngah a muttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, chumi ram vêkah chuan berâm vêngtute an awm a, zânah an berâmho an vêng a, phûlah an riahchilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vântirhkoh pakhat an kiangah a lo ding a, Lalpa ropuinain an vêl chu a rawn chhun êng a; tichuan, an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh chuan an hnênah, “Hlau suh ulang, ngai rawh u, mi tin ta tûr Chanchin Ṭha lâwmawm êm êm ka rawn thlen che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawiinah hian in tân Davida khuaah Chhandamtu a piang ta, Lal Krista chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, hei hi in tân chhinchhiahna tûr a ni; nausên puana tuam, ran chaw pêkna thlênga mu in hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, thâwk leh khatah vântirhkoh hnênah chuan vâna miho mipui an lo awm ta chiam a, Pathian an fak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chungnung berah Pathian ropui takin awm rawh se, Lei chunga a lawm êm êm mihringte hnênah rem thu lêng rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, vântirhkohte chuan vâna an kalsan veleh berâm vêngtute chuan, “Tûnah Bethlehem khaw thlengin kal ila, Lalpan thu min hrilh lo thleng chu i en ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, an kal thuai thuai a, Mari nên, Josefa nên, ran chaw pêkna thlênga nausên mu nên chuan an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an va hmuh chuan nausên chanchin thu vântirhkohvin a hrilh kha an sawi vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a hria apiang chuan berâm vêngtute thusawi chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mari erawh chuan thusawi zawng zawng chu a rilruin a ngaihtuah a, a vawng reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, berâm vêngtute chuan vântirhkoh hrilh ang ngeia engkim an hmuha an hriat avângin, Pathian chawimawi leh fak chung zêlin an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a serh tanna tûr ni riat a lo tlin chuan, a hmingah chuan, chhûla a awm hma rênga vântirhkohvin a sak tawh sa, Isua an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Mosia dân anga an inthen ni a lo thlen chuan, ani chu (Lalpa dân thua, “Mipa fa chhûl keu apiang chu Lalpa tâna ruat an ti ang,” tia ziak ang khân) Lalpa hnêna hlân tûr leh, Lalpa dân thûa ziak angin ṭhuro tuak khat emaw, pârvano pahnih emaw talh tûrin Jerusalem khuaah an han hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Jerusalem khuaah chuan mi pakhat, a hming Sumeona a awm; chu mi chu mi fel tak leh Pathian ngaihsak tak a ni a, Israel-te thlamuantu tûr chu a nghâk reng a, a chungah Thlarau Thianghlim a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa Krista chu a hmuh hma loh chuan a thi lo vang tih Thlarau Thianghlimin a lo hriattîr tawh rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Thlarau hriattîrin Pathian biak inah chuan a va lût a; nausên Isua chu a nu leh a pain, dân pângngai anga a chunga tihsak tûra an rawn hruai luh lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ani chuan a lo kuangkuah a, Pathian a fak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Lalpa, tûnah i thu ang zêlin, I bâwih hi thlamuang takin i kaltîr dâwn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I chhandamna mi tin hmuha i siam kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka mitin a hmu ta e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentail-te hnêna i êng puang chhuak tûr leh I mi Israel-te ropuina tûr chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, nausên thu a sawi chu a nu leh a pa chuan mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Sumeona chuan anni chu mal a sâwm a, a nu Mari hnênah, “Ngai rawh, he naupang hi Israel zînga mi tam tak tiral tûr leh din chhuahtîr tûra ruat a ni, miin an hnial tûr chhinchhiahna nên-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />a ni, nanga thinlung pawh ngûnhnâmin a la chhun tlang ang, mi tam takin an thinlunga an ngaihtuahte chu a lan nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat, a hming Anni, zâwlnei, Phanuela fanu, Asera hnama mi a awm a, (ani chu tar tak a ni a, a tawn tirh pasal hnênah kum sarih a awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />tin, kum sawmriat leh kum li zet a hmeithai a,) ani chuan Pathian biak in kalsan lovin, a chhûn a zânin chaw ngheitea ṭawngṭaiin Pathian a be ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai tak chuan ani chu a lo kal a, Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi a, Jerusalem khaw tlan beisei apiangte hnênah chuan Isua chanchin a sawi bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa dân ang zêla thil zawng zawng an tih zawhin, Galili rama anmahni khua Nazareth-ah chuan an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, nausên chu a lo sei lian deuh deuh va, a lo chak telh telh a, finin a khat ta a, Pathian khawngaihna a chungah a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, kum tinin, Kalhlên Kût hunin a nu leh a pa chu Jerusalem khuaah chuan an kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, ani chu kum sâwm leh kum hnih a nihin kût dân pângngaiin an han kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />tin, an ṭiaka, an haw laiin naupang Isua chuan Jerusalem khuaah a awmsan a; a nu leh a pa chuan an hre si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chutichuan, an pâwl zîngah a awm emaw an ti a, ni khat an kal hman a, an laichînte leh an hmêlhriatte zîngah an zawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, an hmuh loh avângin zawng chung zêlin Jerusalem khuaah an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni thum chinah chuan Pathian biak inah, zirtîrtute zînga ṭhua an thu lo ngaithlaa lo zâwtin an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, a thu hria apiang chuan a hriatzia leh a chhânzia chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, a nu leh a pa chuan amah chu an hmuhin mak an ti hle a; tichuan, a nuin a hnênah, “Ka fapa, engati nge hetia min tih? Ngai teh, i pa leh keiin thlaphâng takin kan zawng che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Engah nge mi zawn ni? Ka Pa ina ka awm tûr in hre lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, an hnêna a thusawi chu a ngaihna an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah a kal thla a, Nazareth khua chu a zu thleng a, an thu zâwmin a awm a. Tin, a nu chuan chûng thil zawng zawng chu a rilruah a vawng reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a fing deuh deuh va, a lo lian telh telh a, Pathian leh mihring duhsakin a awm deuh deuh va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Tiberia Kaisara a lal achin kum sâwm leh kum nga kumah (Pontia Pilata chu Judai ram awptu a ni a. Heroda chu Galili ram lal a ni a, a unau Philipa chu Iturea leh Trakonitis ram lal a ni a, Lusania chu Abilene ram lal a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ana leh Kaiapha chu puithiam lalberte an ni a), thlalêrah Zakaria fapa Johana hnênah chuan Pathian thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chu Jordan lui kam vêl ram tinah a kal a, thil tihsual ngaihdam nân simna baptisma thu a hril zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia thu buah: “Thlalêra mi au râwl chuan, ‘Lalpa lamlian sial ula, A kawngte tingîl rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kawr tin chhûn khah a ni vek ang a, Tlâng tin mual tin tihhniam a ni bawk ang; Kawng kawite a lo ngîl ang a, Kawng bumbohte a lo rual bawk ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin Pathian chhandamna chu an hmu ang,’ a ti,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan baptisma chang tûra a hnêna mipui lo chhuakte hnênah chuan, “Rûl thlahte u, thinur lo thleng tûr hi tlânsan tûrin tuin nge zilh che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, sim hming pu tlâkin rah rawh u, ‘Abrahama kan thlahtu a ni alâwm,’ in rilruin ti mai suh ang che u; Pathianin hêng lungte hi Abrahama thlahahte a dintîr thei e, ka tih che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûn apangin thingbul tinah hreipui an dah ta; chutichuan, thing tin rah ṭhaa rah lo apiang an kit a, meiah an paih ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chuan a hnênah, “Eng nge kan tih tûr le?” an ti a, an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tu pawh kawr pahnih nei chuan a nei lo hnênah pe rawh se; tu pawh ei nei chuan chutiang bawkin ti rawh se,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chhiahkhawntute pawh baptisma chang tûrin an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, eng nge kan tih tûr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “An rêlsak ang che u aliam chu va phût suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, sipaite pawhin a hnênah, “Keini pawhin eng nge kan tih tûr?” an ti a, an zâwt a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tu mah tiduhdahin va hêk suh u; in hlawh tâwk apiangah lungawi rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, miten an beisei a, mi zawng zawngin Johana chung thu an thinlungah, “Krista a lo ni mial dah law maw?” tia an ngaihtuah laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Johana chuan a chhâng a, an zaa hnênah, “Kei zawngin tuiin ka baptis ṭhîn che u a; nimahsela, keimah aia ropui zâwk a lo kal dâwn e, a pheikhawk hrui phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve; ani chuan Thlarau Thianghlim leh meiin a baptis ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kutin a sisêp a keng a, a hruih zah fai hliauna tûr leh a zêma a buh khungna tûrin; a si erawh chu mei mit thei lovin a hâl ral ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, fuihna thu dang tam takin mite hnênah Chanchin Ṭha a hril ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, lal Heroda chu a nau nupui Herodi chung thûah leh a thil tihsual zawng zawng chungah chuan Johanan a zilhhau avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a thil tihsual zawng zawng belhchhahin Johana chu tân inah a khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, mi zawng zawngin baptisma an chan zawhin Isua pawhin baptisma a chang a, a ṭawngṭai a, vân a lo inhawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim chu taksa puin ṭhuro angin a lo chhuk a, a chungah a fu ta a; tin, vân aṭangin aw a lo chhuak a, “Nang, ka fapa duh tak i ni; i chungah ka lâwm êm êm e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a zirtîr ṭan tirh lai khân amah chu kum sawmthum lai a ni tawh a, mi ngaih chuan Josefa fapa a ni a, chu mi chu Helia fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chu mi chu Matthata fa a ni a, chu mi chu Levia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Melkia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Janna fa a ni a, chu mi chu Josefa fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />chu mi chu Mattathia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Amosa fa a ni a, chu mi chu Nahuma fa a ni a, chu mi chu Eslia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Naggaia fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chu mi chu Maatha fa a ni a, chu mi chu Mattathia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Semeia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Joseka fa a ni a, chu mi chu Joda fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />chu mi chu Joana fa a ni a, chu mi chu Hrisa fa a ni a, chu mi chu Zerubabela fa a ni a, chu mi chu Salathiela fa a ni a, chu mi chu Neria fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />chu mi chu Melkia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Addia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Kosama fa a ni a, chu mi chu Elmadama fa a ni a, chu mi chu Era fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />chu mi chu Isua fa a ni a, chu mi chu Eliezera fa a ni a, chu mi chu Jorima fa a ni a, chu mi chu Matthata fa a ni a, chu mi chu Levia fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />chu mi chu Sumeona fa a ni a, chu mi chu Juda fa a ni a, chu mi chu Josefa fa a ni a, chu mi chu Jonama fa a ni a, chu mi chu Eliakima fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />chu mi chu Melea fa a ni a, chu mi chu Menna fa a ni a, chu mi chu Mattatha fa a ni a, chu mi chu Nathana fa a ni a, chu mi chu Davida fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />chu mi chu Jesaia fa a ni a, chu mi chu Obeda fa a ni a, chu mi chu Boaza fa a ni a, chu mi chu Salmona fa a ni a, chu mi chu Nasona fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />chu mi chu Aminadaba fa a ni a, chu mi chu Arama fa a ni a, chu mi chu Esroma fa a ni a, chu mi chu Pharesa fa a ni a, chu mi chu Juda fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />chu mi chu Jakoba fa a ni a, chu mi chu Isaaka fa a ni a, chu mi chu Abrahama fa a ni a, chu mi chu Tera fa a ni a, chu mi chu Nahora fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />chu mi chu Seruga fa a ni a, chu mi chu Reuva fa a ni a, chu mi chu Pelega fa a ni a, chu mi chu Ebera fa a ni a, chu mi chu Sela fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />chu mi chu Kainana fa a ni a, chu mi chu Arpaksada fa a ni a, chu mi chu Sema fa a ni a, chu mi chu Nova fa a ni a, chu mi chu Lameka fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />chu mi chu Methusela fa a ni a, chu mi chu Enoka fa a ni a, chu mi chu Jareda fa a ni a, chu mi chu Mahalalela fa a ni a, chu mi chu Kainana fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />chu mi chu Enosa fa a ni a, chu mi chu Setha fa a ni a, chu mi chu Adama fa a ni a, chu mi chu Pathian fa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, Jordan lui aṭangin a kîr leh a, Diabola thlêm chungin thlalêrah ni sawmli Thlarau hruaiin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chûng ni chuan eng mah a ei lo; tin, a tâwpah chuan a ril a lo ṭâm ta a. Tin, Diabola chuan a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih chuan he lung hi chhanga chang tûrin thu pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘Mihring hi chhang chauhvin an nung lo vang,’ tih ziak a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a hruai chho va, mit khap kâr lovah khawvêl ram zawng zawng a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Diabola chuan a hnênah, “Hêng zawng zawng chunga thuneihna leh a ropuina hi ka pe ang che; ka hnêna pêk a ni tawh si a, ka duh apiang hnênah ka pe bawk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, chibai mi bûk la, a zain i ta a ni vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian chibai bûk la, ama rawng chauh bâwl rawh,’ tih ziak a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Diabola chuan Jerusalem khuaah a hruai a, Pathian biak in chhîp zumah chuan a dah a; tin, a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih chuan heta ṭang hian tla thla rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Nangmah humhim tûr chein, I chung thûah zawng A vântirhkohte chu thu a pe ang,’ tih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘An kutin an dâwm ang chia; Chuti lo chuan, i kein lung i chhuih hlauh dah ang e,’ tih ziak a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian fiah suh,’ tih a ni e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Diabola chuan a thlêmna tûr tinrênga a thlêm zawh chuan, a remchân hun atân a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Thlarau thiltihtheihna puin Galili ramah a haw leh ta a; tin, a chanchin chu, chumi vêl ram tinah chuan a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an inkhâwmna inahte a zirtîr zêl a, mi zawng zawng fakin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a seilenna khua Nazareth chu a lo thleng a; tin, Chawlhnia a tih dân pângngaiin inkhâwmna inah a lût a, chhiar tûrin a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu chu a hnênah an pe a. Tin, lehkhabu zial chu a phelh a, he thu ziakna lai hi a chhar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Riangvaite hnênah Chanchin Ṭha hril tûra mi ruat avângin, Lalpa Thlarau chu ka chungah a awm; Ani chuan salte hnêna chhuahna thu leh, Mitdelte hnêna mitvâr neih lehna thu sawi tûr te, Tihduhdah tuarte chhuahtîrna tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa lungawi kum thu sawi tûr tein, mi tîr a ni,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, lehkhabu chu a zial a, rawngbâwltu a pe leh a, a ṭhu ta a. Tin, inkhâwmna ina mi zawng zawng mit chu a chungah a fu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “He Pathian Lehkha Thu hi vawiinah hian in hriatah a lo thleng ta,” tiin a sawi ṭan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an zain amah an fak a, a kamchhuak khawngaih thute chu mak an ti hle a. Tin, “He mi hi Josefa fapa a ni lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangnin he tehkhin thu hi, ‘Dâktawr, nangmah intidam rawh,’ ‘Kapernaum khuaa i thiltih kan lo hriat apiang kha, hetah nangma khaw lamah pawh hian ti rawh,’ tiin mi la hrilh dâwn ngei nâk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, zâwlnei tu mah mahni khaw lama miin an lâwm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, dik takin ka ti a che u, Elija dam laia kum thum leh thla ruk vân a pina, khawvêla ṭâm nasa tak a lo tlâk khân, Israel ramah hmeithai tam tak an awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nimahsela, an zînga tu hnênah mah Elija tirh a ni lo va, Sidon ram lama Sarepta khuaa hmeichhe pakhat hmeithai hnênah chauh tirh a nih zâwk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Elisa dam lai pawh khân Israel ramah phâr tam tak an awm a; nimahsela, an zîngah tu mah tihthianghlimin an awm lo va, Naamana, Suria rama mi chauh tihthianghlima a awm tâk zâwk kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna ina mi zawng zawng chuan chûng thu chu an hriat veleh, an lo thinur êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an tho hlawm a, khua ata chu an nam chhuak a, paih thlâk tûrin an khaw awmna khâm kovah chuan an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu an kârah a kal tlang a, a kal ta zêl mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Galili rama khaw pakhat, Kapernaum-ah chuan a zuk kal ta a. Tin, Chawlhniah mite a zirtîr a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tin, thunei taka a sawi avângin a thu zirtîr chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna inah chuan ramhuai bawlhhlawh thlarau pai mi pakhat a lo awm a; ani chu aw ring takin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“A! Nazareth Isu, keini leh nang eng nge kan inzâwlna awm? Min tiboral tûrin i lo kal em ni? Nang ka hria a che, Pathian Mi Thianghlima i ni e,” tiin a au chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hau va, “Ngawi la, a chhûng ata lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ramhuai chuan a laiah a titlu zet a, tina lovin a chhûng ata chu a lo chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, an zain mak an ti hle a, “Hei hi eng thu nge ni le? Thunei tak leh thiltithei takin ramhuai bawlhhlawhte thu a pe a, an chhuah hi,” tiin an inbia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, chumi vêl ram khaw tinah a chanchin a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, inkhâwmna in ata chu a chhuak a, Simona inah a lût ta a. Tin, Simona nupuia nu chu nasa takin a khua a lo sik a; tichuan, a tân an lo ngensak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a kiangah a ding a, khawsik chu a hau va, a reh ta a; tin, a tho ta nghâl a, an rawng a bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, ni tlâk dâwn laiin natna hrang hranga nâ, damlo nei apiangin a hnênah an rawn hruai a; tin, an zaa chungah chuan a kut a nghat ṭheuh va, a tidam ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ramhuaite pawh, “Pathian Fapa i ni,” tia auvin mi tam tak kawchhûng ata an lo chhuak a. Tin, anmahni a hau va, Krista a ni tih an hriat avângin an ṭawng a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, khawvâr veleh a chhuak a, thlalêr hmunah a kal a; tin, mipuite chuan an zawng a, a hnênah an lo kal a, anmahni a kalsan loh nân chelh an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan an hnênah, “Khaw dangahte pawh Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha ka hril tûr a ni, chumi avâng chuan tirh ka ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tichuan, Galili rama inkhâwmna inahte thu a hril a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, mipuiin Pathian thu an ngaihthlâka amah an bâwr huai huai laiin, ani chu Gennesaret dîl kamah chuan a ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, dîl kamah chuan lawng pahnih awm a hmu a; nimahsela, sangha mantute chu an chhuak a, an lênte an su a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, lawng pakhat, Simona ta zâwkah chuan a chuang a, a hnênah vaukam ata tlêma tawlh luh deuh a dîl a. Tin, a ṭhu a, lawng aṭang chuan mipuite chu a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, thusawi a bân chuan Simona hnênah, “Li thûk lam pan la, sangha man tûrin in lênte dêng rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Simonan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, rim takin zankhuain kan bei a, eng mah kan man lo va; nimahsela, i thuin lênte ka dêng leh ang e,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an han den chuan sangha tam tak an khuh a, an lênte chu a chat pheuh pheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, lawng danga an pâwlpui awmte chu anmahni rawn pui tûrin kutin an hui a. Tin, an lo kal a, lawng pahnih chu pil lek lek khawpin an chhûng khat ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Simon Peteran chu chu a hmuh chuan Isua khûp kiangah a bawkkhup a, “Lalpa, mi kalsan rawh, mi sual ka nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An sangha man chu ani leh a ṭhianten mak an ti hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simona pâwl vêk Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh Johana pawhin mak an ti hle bawk a. Tin, Isuan Simona hnênah, “Hlau suh, tûn hnuah zawng mihring i man tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an lawngte chu vaukamah an dah a, engkim kalsanin amah chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, khaw pakhata a awm laiin ngai teh, mi pakhat phâr bawm hi a awm a, ani chuan Isua a lo hmu a, lei siin a bawkkhup a, “Lalpa, i duh chuan mi tithianghlim thei e,” a ti a, a ngên chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a han ban a, a dek a, “Ka duh e, lo thianghlim tawh ang che,” a ti a. Tin, chawplehchilhin a phâr chu a lo reh ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Tu mah hrilh suh; amaherawhchu, puithiam va inentîr la, i inthen nân Mosia ruat angin hlân rawh, mite hriattîrna tûrin,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, a chanchin thu chu a thang lehzual sauh va; mipui tam tak a thu hriat duh leh an nâte tihdam duhin an rawn inkhâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu thlalêrahte a kal hrang a, a ṭawngṭai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng lai chuan ni khat chu a zirtîr a. Tin, a kiangah Pharisaite leh dân zirtîrtute ṭhuin an awm a, chûngte chu Galili leh Judai ram khaw tin aṭang leh Jerusalem khua aṭanga lo chhuak an ni a; tin, mi tihdam nân Lalpa thiltihtheihna chu a hnênah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, khum chawpin zeng pakhat an rawn zâwn a; a hmaa dah tûrin zâwn luh an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mipui avâng chuan zâwn luhna rêng an hmu lo va, in chungah an lâwn chho va, in chung aṭangin, a lai takah, Isua hmaah a khum chawpin an puh thlâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, an rinzia chu a lo hmuhin a hnênah chuan, “Mihring, i sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaite chuan, “Pathian sawi chhia hi tu nge maw a nih le? Pathian chauh lo chuan tuin nge sualte ngaidam thei ni?” tiin an ngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan an ngaihtuah chu a hria a, an hnênah chuan, “In thinlungah eng nge in ngaihtuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘I sualte ngaihdam a ni tawh,’ tih leh, ‘Tho la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ tih hi a eng nge sawi awl zâwk ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, khawvêlah Mihring Fapa hian sual ngaihdam theihna a nei tih in hriat nân,” a ti a, (zeng hnênah chuan) “Tho la, i khum la la, i inah kal rawh ka ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, an mit hmuhah a tho ta nghâl a, a mutna chu a la a, Pathian fak chung zêlin a inah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, an zain mak an ti hle a, Pathian an fak a, “Vawiinah chuan thilmak tak kan hmu a ni,” an ti a, an hlau êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chûng zawhah chuan a chhuak a, chhiah chawina hmuna ṭhu, chhiahkhawntu pakhat, a hming Levia a hmu a; tin, a hnênah, “Mi rawn zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, engkim a kalsan a, a tho va, a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Levia chuan a inah Isua tân ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a; tichuan, chhiahkhawntute leh mi dangte nên, mi tam takin anmahni an kîlpui hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite leh an lehkhaziaktute chu a zirtîrte chungah an phunnawi a, “Engati nge chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte hnêna in eia, in in le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Mi hrisêlte chuan dâktawr an ngai lo va, mi bawrhsâwmte zâwkin an ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi fel takte lam tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, mi sualte lama simtîr tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, annin a hnênah, “Johana zirtîrten chaw an nghei fo va, an ṭawngṭai ṭhîn; Pharisai zirtîrte pawhin chutiang bawkin an ti ṭhîn; nimahsela, i zirtîrte hian an eiin an in ṭhin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mo hruaitute hnêna a pasal tûr chu a awm chhûng zawng, mo hruaitute chu in ngheitîr thei ṭhîn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nimahsela, a pasal tûr chu an hnên ata hruai bo nite a la thleng ang a, chumi nîah erawh chuan an la nghei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah tehkhin thu pawh a sawi a: “Tu mân puan thar pawt thlain puan hluiah an bel ngai lo; bel ang sela, a thar chuan a tiṭet ang a, a thar them leh a hlui chu a inpâwl bawk hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, tu mân uain thar savun uain peng hluiahte an thun ngai lo, thun ang sela, uain thar chuan savun pengte chu a tâwn puak ang a, a bua ang a, savun pengte pawh chu a lo chhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Uain thar chu savun uain peng tharahte an thun zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, tu mân uain rei in zawhin a thar an duh ngai lo; ‘A rei a ṭha zâwk,’ an ti si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Chawlhni vawi khat chu buh hmunahte an kal tlang a; a zirtîrte chuan buh vuite chu an thliak a, an kutphahin an nuai fai a, an ei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pharisai tute emaw chuan, “Engati nge Chawlhnia tih thiang lo chu in tih ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, “Davida a rilṭâm laia a ṭhiante nêna an thiltih kha, khâng angte pawh kha in chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatia Pathian ina a luha, puithiamte chauh lo chuan ei thian loh chhangdah chu a lâka, a eia, a ṭhiante hnêna a pêk ve thu kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah chuan, “Mihring Fapa hi Chawlhni Lal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Chawlhni dangah chuan inkhâwmna inah a lût a, a zirtîr a; tin, chutah chuan mi pakhat kut ding lam zeng a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaite chuan a hêkna tûr an hmuh theih nân, Chawlhnia a tihdam dâwn leh dâwn loh an mitmei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, anin an rilru chu a hria a, kut zeng hnênah chuan, “Tho la, a laiah ding chhuak rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a tho va, a ding chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Chawlhniah hian tihṭhat nge thiang tihchhiat? Chhandam nge thiang tihhlum? Ka zâwt a che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an za chuan a en vêl a, a hnênah, “I kut phar rawh,” a ti a. Tin, a phar a, a kut chu a dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, an thin tâwtin an puak keh lek lek a, Isua chunga an tih zia tûrah an inrâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai chuan heti hi a ni a, a chhuak a, ṭawngṭai tûrin tlângah a kal a, Pathian hnênah a ṭawngṭai zankhua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, khawvâr veleh a zirtîrte chu a ko va; an zîng ata sâwm leh pahnih a thlang a, an hmingah pawh tirhkoh a vuah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chûngte chu Simona (Petera a vuah bawk kha) leh a unau Andria te, Jakoba leh Johana te, Philipa leh Bartholomaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Matthaia leh Thoma te, Alphaia fapa Jakoba te, Simona, Zelota an vuah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoba fapa Juda te, mi vervêk Juda Iskariota te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an rualin a kal chhuk a, hmun zâwlah a ding a, a zirtîr mipui tam tak nên, Judai ram zawng zawng ata leh Jerusalem khua ata leh, Tura leh Sidon khaw lama tuifinriat kam ata mi tam tak nên, chûngho chu a thu ngai duh leh an nate intihdam duhin an lo kal a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tichuan, ramhuai bawlhhlawh sawisakte pawh an lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a hnên ata thiltihtheihna a chhuaha, mi tin a tihdam avângin mipui zawng zawng chuan amah deh an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a dâk chhuak a, a zirtîrte chu a en a. “Nangni retheite u, in eng a thâwl e; Pathian ram in ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangni tûna rilṭâmte u, in eng a thâwl e; In la tlai dâwn si a. Nangni tûna ṭapte u, in eng a thawl e; In la nui dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihring Fapa avânga miten an huat che ua, an tuithlâr che ua, an hau che ua, in hming a ṭha lo tia an paih bo dêr hunah in eng a la thâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan lâwm ulang, hlimin zuang rawh u; ngai teh u, vânah in lâwmman a awm hnem si a; chutiang bawkin an thlahtuten zâwlneite chungah an tih ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nangni mi hausate u, in chung a pik e; in thlamuanna in hmu tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangni tûna tlai puarte u, in chung a pik e; in ril a la ṭâm dâwn si a. Nangni tûna nuite u, in chung a pik e; lungngaiin in la ṭap dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin an fak hunah che u, in chung a la pik ang, chutiang bawkin an thlahtuten zâwlnei derte chunga an tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thu ngaitute u, ka hrilh a che u, in hmêlmate chu hmangaih ula, a hua che u chu an ṭhatna tûr ti ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ânchhe lawhtu che u chu malsâwmsak ula, a sawisatu che u chu ṭawngṭaisak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Biang lehlama bêngtu che chu lehlam pawh dawh rawh; tin, i puan lâksaktua hnênah chuan i kawr lâk pawh hnial suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dîltu apiang che hnênah pe rawh; tin, i sum lâksaktu che hnênah chuan dîl leh tawh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, miin in chunga an tiha in duh tûr ang zêlin, mi chungah pawh ti ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, in hmangaitute chauh in hmangaih hian, lawm eng nge in hlawh ang? Mi sualte pawhin an hmangaitute chu an hmangaih ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, in chunga ṭhate chungah chauh in ṭhat hian, lawm eng nge in hlawh ang? Mi sualte pawhin chutiang bawkin an ti ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, hmuh leh beiseina hnên chauhva thil in pûktîr hian, lawm eng nge in hlawh ang? Mi sualte pawhin a ngai vêka hmu leh tûrin mi sualte hnênah an pûktîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, in hmêlmate hmangaih ula, an ṭhatna tûr ti ula, pûktîr rawh u, beidawng hauh lovin; tichuan, in lâwmman a tam ang a, Chungnungbera fate in ni bawk ang; ani chuan mi lâwm nachâng hre lote leh mi sualte a khawngaih ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />In Pain mi a khawngaih angin mi khawngaih ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Sawisêl suh u; chutichuan, sawisêlin in awm lo vang; tu mah thiam lovah ruat suh u; chutichuan, thiam lohvin in awm lo vang; ngaidam rawh u; chutichuan, ngaihdamin in awm ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />pe rawh u; chutichuan, pêkin in awm ang; ṭhahnemngai taka teha, beng muka, sâwi muka, liam zawih zawihin in malchungah an pe ang che u. In tehna ngai bawkin an tehsak leh dâwn si che u a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi a, “Mitdelin mitdel vêk a hruai thei ang em? An pahnihin khuarkhurumah an tla dûn lo vang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zirtîr chu a zirtîrtu chungah a awm lo; nimahsela, mi tin an zir zawhin an zirtîrtu angin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, engati nge mahni mita khanchhuk awm chu ngaihtuah si lovin, i unau mita hmawlh tê tak tê awm chu i hmuh ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mahni mita khanchhuk awm chu hmu si lovin, i unau hnênah, ‘Unau, i mita hmawlh tê tak tê awm kha mi lâk chhuahtîr rawh,’ engtin nge i tih theih le? Mi vervêk! I mit ata khanchhuk kha la chhuak hmasa rawh; chutichuan, i unau mit ata hmawlh tê tak tê lâk chhuah tûr chu fiah takin i hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thing ṭha rêng rêng rah chhiaa rah a awm lo; thing chhia lah rah ṭhaa rah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thing tin anmahni rah ṭheuhvah a hriat a ni. Miin hruihlîngnei kûngah theipui an lo ngai lo, nghardai kûngah grêp rah an lo ngai bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mi ṭha chuan a thinlung ro bâwm ṭha ata thil ṭhate a theh chhuak ṭhîn a; mi sual chuan a thinlung ro bâwm chhia ata thil chhiate a theh chhuak ṭhîn; thinlunga khat liam chu a kâin a sawi ṭhîn a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, nangnin eng atân nge, ka thu zâwm si lova, ‘Lalpa, Lalpa,’ mi tih ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mi tin ka hnêna lo kala, ka thu hriaa zâwm apiang chu tu ang nge an nih ka hriattîr ang che u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />in satu, thûk taka laia, lungpui chunga lungphûm rema ang chu an ni; tin, tui a lo lenin, tuizangkhauhvin chu mi in chu a khawh a, a tinghîng thei lo va, a sak ngun avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hriaa zâwm lo chu, lung phûm lova, lei chung maia in satu ang chu a ni; tin, tuizangkhauhvin chu chu a khawh a, a chim ta nghâl a; chu in sawp chu nasa tak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mite beng hriata a thu zawng zawng a sawi zawhin, Kapernaum khuaah a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu tu emaw a bâwih duh tak a damlo va, a thi lek lek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chanchin a hriat veleh, a bâwih rawn tidam tûra ngên chiam tûrin a hnênah Juda-ho upate a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, anni chu Isua hnênah an va thleng a, ṭhahnemngai takin an ngên chiam a, “Ani hi hei hi i tihsak tlâk a ni e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kan hnamte a hmangaih a, kan inkhâwmna in pawh aman min saksak a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu an hnênah a kal ta a. Tin, in a thlen dâwn hnaihin, sipai za hotu chuan a hnênah a ṭhiante a tîr a, “Lalpa, lo kal harsa suh, ka in chhûng i luhna tlâk a ni lo ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chuvângin, i hnêna lo kal tlâk pawh niin ka inring lo va; thu chauh sawi la, ka naupang a dam mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei pawh mi thûa awm ka ni a, ka hnuaiah sipaite an awm a; chu mi kha mi chu, ‘Kal rawh,’ ka tih leh a kal ṭhîn; mi dang hnênah pawh, ‘Lo haw rawh,’ ka tih leh a lo haw ṭhîn; ka bâwih hnênah pawh, ‘Hei hi ti rawh,’ ka tih leh a ti ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chûng thu chu a hriatin amah chu mak a ti hle a, a hawi a, mipui a zuitute hnênah chuan, “Ka hrilh a che u, Israel-te zîngah pawh heti êma rinna nasa hi ka hmu lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a mi tirhte chu inah an haw leh a, bâwih chu damin an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, rei lo têan khaw pakhat Nain an tihah chuan a kal a; a zirtîrte leh mipui tam tak a hnênah an kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, kulh kawngkhâr kiang a thlenin, ngai teh, mitthi an rawn zâwn chhuak a, a nu fapa neih chhun a ni a, a nu chu hmeithai a ni si a; an khuate tam tak chu a hnênah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan hmeithai chu a hmuh veleh a khawngaih êm êm a, “Ṭap suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a va hnaih a, hlâng chu a khawih a; tichuan, a zâwntute chu an ding ta a. Tin, “Râwlthar, tho rawh, ka ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mitthi chu a lo ṭhu chhuak a, a rawn ṭawng ta a. Tin, Isua chuan a nu hnênah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin an hlau va, Pathian an fak a, “Kan zîngah zâwlnei ropui tak a lo awm ta a ni,” an ti a, “Pathianin a mite a rawn tlawh ta a ni,” an ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, chumi chungchâng thu chu, Judai ram zawng zawngah leh a kiang vêl ram tinah a thang chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Johana zirtîrte chuan chûng thu zawng zawng chu Johana an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, Johanan a zirtîrte pahnih a ko va, Lalpa hnênah chuan a tîr a, “Lo kal tûra chu i ni nge, mi dang kan la ngai ang?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mite chu a hnênah an lo thlen chuan, “Baptistu Johanan, ‘Lo kal tûra chu i ni nge, mi dang kan la ngai ang?’ tiin i hnênah min tîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chûng lai tak chuan Isuan nâte, hripui veite, ramhuai mante tam tak a tidam a, mitdel tam takte pawh an mit a tivâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Kal leh ta ulang, thil in hmuh leh in hriat hi Johana va hrilh rawh u; mitdelte an mit a lo vâr ta, kebaite kein an lo kal ta, phârte an lo thianghlim ta, bengngawngte pawh an beng a lo vâr ta, mitthite kaihthawhin an awm ta, pachhiaten Chanchin Ṭha hrilh an dawng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, tu pawh ka chunga lungnih lohna hmu lo chu an eng a thâwl e,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Johana tirhkohte chu an hâwn hnuin, Isuan mipui hnênah chuan Johana thu a sawi ta a, “Eng en tûrin nge thlalêra in kal chhuah kha? Luang, thli chhêm nghîn maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nih loh leh, eng en tûr berin nge in kal chhuah kha? Puan nêm sin maw? Ngai rawh u, puan ropui sin leh mi nuamsate chu lal inahte asin an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nih loh leh, eng en tûr berin nge in kal chhuah kha? Zâwlnei maw? A nih ngei kha, ka ti a che u, zâwlnei ai pawha ropui zâwk -
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘En teh, ka tirhkoh i hmaan ka tîr a ni, Ani chuan i hmaah i kawng a siam ang,’ tih, a chanchin an ziaka kha, he mi hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hmeichhe hrin zîngah Johana aia ropui zâwk an awm lo; nimahsela, Pathian rama mi tê deuh pawh ani ai chuan an ropui zâwk, ka ti a che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin an hriatin, chhiahkhawntute nên, Johana baptisma lo chang tawh an ni a, Pathian an thiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pharisaite leh dânhretute erawh chu a hnêna baptisma lo chang tawh an ni ve lo va, anmahni tân Pathianin rem a ruatsak kha an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isua vêkin, “Tûnlai chhuante hi eng nên nge ka tehkhin ang le? Eng ang nge nih pawh an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Naupang, dâwr hmuna ṭhua, ‘Phênglâwng kan tumsak che u a, in lâm si lo va; kan ṭap vak a, in ṭap si lo va,’ tia inauvate ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baptistu Johana chu a lo kal a, chhang a ei lo va, uain pawh a in lo va, nangnin, ‘Ramhuai a zâwl a nih hi,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihring Fapa a lo kal a, a eiin a in a, nangnin, ‘En teh u, chaw heh mi, uain heh mi, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte ṭhian saw!’ in ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nimahsela, finna chu a rah aṭangin a dikzia a lang a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin Pharisaite zînga mi pakhatin a hnêna chaw eiah a sâwm a. Tin, Pharisai inah chuan a lût a, chaw a kîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, chumi khuaa hmeichhe sual pakhat awm chuan Pharisai inah chaw kîlin a ṭhu tih a hriat veleh, alabasta bâwmin hriak rimtui a rawn keng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a hnungah a kephah bulah chuan ṭap chungin a ding a, a mittuiin a kephah a lo far huh a, a samin a hru a, a kephah chu a fâwp ngawih ngawih a, hriak rimtui chuan a chulh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a sâwmtu Pharisai chuan chu chu a hmuh chuan a rilruin, “He mi hi zâwlnei a nih chuan a dektu hmeichhia hi tu nge a nih, mi eng ang nge a nih hriat âwm tak lah ni, mi sual a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Simon, i hnênah thu kam khat sawi tûr ka nei,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Tin, ani chuan, “Sawi ta che, Zirtîrtu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Tangka pûktîrtu tuin emaw leiba pahnih a nei a: pakhatin duli zanga a ba a, pakhatin sawmnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, rulhna an nei lo va, a ngaihhna- thiam ve ve a. Chutichuan, chu mite chuan a tuin nge ani chu hmangaih zâwk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simona chuan, “A ngaihhnathiam zual zâwka chuan niin ka ring,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Tin, anin a hnênah, “I ti dik e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe lam chu a hawi a, Simona hnênah chuan, “He hmeichhia hi i hmu em? I inah ka lo lût a, nangin ka kephah silna tûr tui mi pe lo va, ani erawh hi chuan a mittuiin ka kephah a tihuh a, a samin a hru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nangin fawh rêng rêng mi fâwp lo; ani erawh hi chuan ka lo luh tirh ata ka kephah fawh a bâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nangin ka lûah hriak mi thih lo; ani erawh hi chuan ka kephahah hriak rimtui a chulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka ti a che, a sual tam tak kha ngaihdamin a awm ta; ani pawhin a hmangaih ta êm êm a nih hi; amaherawhchu, ngaihdam tlêm chuan tlêmin a hmangaih ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I sualte ngaihdam a ni ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, a chaw kîlpuite chuan, “Sualte pawh ngaidam hi tu nge maw ni le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, anin hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I rinna hi chhandam i nih phah a ni; thlamuang takin kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, nakin deuhvah chuan Isuan thuhril leh Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha thlen chungin, khaw lian leh khaw tête a fang zêl a, a hnênah sâwm leh pahnihte chu an awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />hmeichhia tute emaw ramhuaizâwl dam lehte leh na dam lehte nên. Chûng hmeichhiate chu Mari, a kawchhûng ata ramhuai pasarih chhuak, Magdalini an tih te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heroda sum enkawltu Chuza nupui Joani te, Susani te, mi dang tam takte nên an ni; chûngte chuan mahni neihin a rawng an bâwlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mipui tam tak an rawn inkhâwm a, khaw tina mi a hnêna an lo kalin, tehkhin thuin thu a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Buh chi thehtu a buh chi thehin a feh a; tin, a theh laiin a ṭhen kalkawng dungah a tla a, miin an rap a, chunglêng savaten an tlân zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen pialtlêp chungah a tla a; tin, a ṭiah veleh a hnâwn loh avângin a râwp ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen hnimhlîngnei zîngah a tla a, hnim chuan a ṭo rualpui a, a dîp ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhen lei ṭhaah a tla a, a lo ṭo va, a leh zain a rah ta a,” a ti a. Tin, chûng thu chu a sawi laiin a au va, “Tu pawh hriatna tûra beng nei chuan hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “He tehkhin thu hi eng tihna nge ni?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Pathian ram thurûkte chu nangni hriat zawng phal a ni a, mi dang hnênah erawh chuan tehkhin thu chauhvin sawi a ni; hmu mah sela, hmu lo an nih theih nân, bengin hre mah sela, a ngaihna an hriat theih loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tehkhin thu kha hei hi a ni: buh chi chu Pathian thu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, kawng dunga mi chu thu hre tawhte hi an ni; tin, Diabola chu a lo kal a, an âwih lohva, chhandam an nih theih loh nân an rilru ata chu a lâksak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, pialtlêp chunga mi chu hêng mi hi an ni: an hriat veleh thu chu lâwm taka pawmte hi; nimahsela, zung rêng an nei lo, rei lo tê chauh an âwih a, thlêm an nih hunin an bânsan leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, hnimhlîngnei zînga tla chu hêng mi hi an ni: an hriat hnuin an kal a, dam chhûng khawsak lungkhamnate, hausaknate, nawmsaknate chuan a dîp a, an rah puitling ṭhîn lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei ṭhaa mi erawh chu hêng mi hi an ni: rilru fel leh ṭhain thu an hria a, an vawng reng a, chhel takin an rah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu mân khâwnvâr hâlin bêlin an khuh lo, khum hnuaiah pawh an dah lo; a lût apiangin a êng an hmuh theih nân a dahnaah an dah zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puan loh tûra zêp eng mah a awm lo va, hriat loh tûr leh lang lo tûra thuhrûk eng mah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, eng angin nge in hriat fîmkhur rawh u: tu pawh a nei apiang an pêk belhchhah ang a; tu pawh a nei lo apiang, neia an inruat chhun pawh an lâksak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a nu leh a unaute chuan Isua lam an rawn pan a; nimahsela, mipui avâng chuan a kiang an thleng thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, “I nu leh i unaute nangmah hmuh tumin pâwnah sâwn an ding reng e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hêng Pathian thu hriaa âwihte hi ka nu leh ka unaute an ni e,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng lai chuan ni khat chu lawngah a chuang a, a zirtîrte nên; tin, an hnênah, “Dîl râl lehlamah sâwn i kai ang u,” a ti a. Tichuan, lawng chu an phelh a, an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, an kal laiin Isua chu a lo muhîl ta a; tin, dîlah chuan thlipui a lo tleh chhuk phut a, an lawng chu tuiin a khat dâwn a, hlauhthâwnawm takin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah an va kal a, an kai tho va, “Zirtîrtu, Zirtîrtu, kan boral dâwn hi le,” an ti a. Tin, ani chu a lo harh a, thli leh tuifâwn chu a hau ta a; tin, a bâng a, a reh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah “Khawiah nge in rinna?” a ti a. Tin, an hlau va, mak an ti hle a, “He mi hi tu nge ni le? Thli leh tui lam pawh thu a pe a, an âwih hi?” an ti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Galili ram zâwna Gerasin mite ram chu an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, khawmuala a chhuahin, khuaa mi ramhuai man tuin emaw a rawn tâwk a; chu mi chu rei tak puan rêng rêng sin lovin a awm a, inah rêng pawh a awm lo va, thlânahte a awm zâwk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Isua a hmuh veleh a au va, a hmaah a bawkkhup a, aw ring takin, “Isu, Pathian Chungnungbera Fapa, kei leh nang eng nge kan inzâwlna awm? Mi nghaisa lul suh ang che, ka ngên a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Isuan ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu, chu mi kawchhûng ata chu chhuak tûrin thu a lo pe tawh si a. Chu mi chu ramhuai chuan a man fo ṭhîn a ni; miten khaidiat leh kawl an buntîr a, an vêng reng ṭhîn a; nimahsela, a phuarnate a tichat a, ramhuaiin thlalêrahte a hnawt chhuak ṭhîn.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “I hming eng nge ni?” tiin a zâwt a. Tin, ani chuan, “Nuaia,” a ti a (a kawchhûnga ramhuai tam tak an luh avângin).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, leilâwta kal thu an hnêna pe lo tûrin Isua hnênah an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan tlângah vawk rual tam tak an tla a; tin, a hnênah vawk kawchhûnga luh an dîl a. Tin, ani chuan thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ramhuaite chu chu mi kawchhûng ata chu an chhuak a, vawk kawchhûngah chuan an lût ta a; tin, vawk rual chu khâmah an tlân chhuk chiam a, dîlah an tlân lût a, tui hâkin an thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, a vulhtute chuan chu thil awmzia chu an hmu a, an tlân a, khuaah leh lovahte chuan an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, “Eng nge lo ni ta?” tia en tûrin an chhuak hlawm a; tin, Isua hnên an lo thleng a, ramhuai chhuahsan hnua chu puan sina rilru pângngai puin, Isua ke bula ṭhu an rawn hmu a; tichuan, an hlau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, a hretute chuan ramhuai man a tihdamzia thu chu chûngho chu an lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a vêl Gerasin rama mi zawng zawng chuan an hlauh êm avângin, ani chu an hnên ata kal bo tûrin an ngên a; tin, lawngah a chuang a, a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ramhuai chhuahsan hnua erawh kha chuan Isua hnêna awm reng a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan, “I inah haw la, Pathianin i tân thil a tihsak che hi a ropuizia va hrilh rawh,” tiin a kaltîr ta a. Tichuan, a kal a, khawpui chhûng zawng zawngah chuan, Isuan a tân thil a tihsak ropuizia chu a tlângaupui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Isua a lo kîr leh chuan mipuiin amah an lâwm a; amah lo nghâk reng an ni hlawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat a hming Jaira, inkhâwmna in hotu chu a lo kal a, Isua ke bulah a bawkkhup a, a ina kalah a ngên a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />fanu mal kum sâwm leh kum hnih emaw lai tûr a nei a, chu mi chu thichhâwnga a lum reng avângin. Tin, Isua a kal laiin mipuihovin an nêk huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe pakhat, kum sâwm leh kum hnih thi pûtin a damlo va, a sum neih zawng zawng chu dâktawrte lakah a dek ral zo tawh a; tu mahin an tidam thei tawh si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />chu mi chu a hnungah a lo kal a, a puan hmâwr a dek a; chawplehchilhin a thi pût chu a lo reh ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Mi dek kha tu nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, “Kei chu ka ni lo,” an ti ṭheuh va. Petera leh a ṭhianten, “Zirtîrtu, mipuiin an nêk huai huai chia, an chîl huai huai che alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan, “Tuin emaw zawng mi dek a ni, thiltihtheihna ka chhûng ata a chhuak tih ka hre nghe nghe asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a inthup theih loh a hria a, khûr chungin a lo kal a, a hmaah a bawkkhup a, a deh chhan leh chawplehchilha a dam tâk nghâlzia chu mi zawng zawng hmuhah chuan a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka fanu, i rinna hi i dampui a ni e; thlamuang takin kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A la ṭawng lai mêkin, inkhâwmna in hotu in ata chu mi pakhat a lo kal a, “I fanu a thi ta, Zirtîrtu hi tihah duh suh,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan chu thu a hriat chuan, “Hlau suh, ring mai rawh; chutichuan, a dam leh ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, in chu a va thlen chuan Petera te, Johana te, Jakoba te, naupang nu leh pate chauh lo chu tu mah luh ve a phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, an zain an lo ṭap tuar tuar a, an âwm an chûm an chûm a; chutichuan, ani chuan, “Ṭap suh u, a thi lo ve, a muhîl a ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, a thi tawh rengin an hre si a, an nuihsan ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a kut a chelh a, “Chêmtê, tho rawh,” a ti a, a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, a thlarau chu a lo kîr leh a, a tho ta nghâl a; tin, englo ei tûr pêk thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, a nu leh a pa chuan mak an ti hle a; nimahsela, ani chuan a thiltih chu tu mah hrilh lo tûrin a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan sâwm leh pahnihte chu a ko khâwm a, ramhuai zawng zawng chunga thiltihtheihna leh thuneihna leh nate tihdam theihna a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian ram thu hril tûr leh damlote tidam tûrin a tîr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Zinna atân tiang emaw, iptê emaw, chhang emaw, tangka emaw eng mah keng suh u; kawr pahnih pawh nei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, in thlenna in apiangah thleng reng zêl ang che u, chu mi in aṭang chuan chhuak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a lâwm lo che u apiang chu, chumi khua ata in chhuah hun chuan, anmahni hriattîrna tûrin, in kephaha vaivut chu thing thla ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, an kal ta a, khua an fang zêl a, ram tinah Chanchin Ṭha an hril a, mi an tidam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lal Herodan a thiltih zawng zawng chu a lo hre ta a; ṭhenkhatin, “Johana kha a nung leh ta a nih hi,” an tiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ṭhenkhatin, “Elija a rawn inlâr ta a nih hi,” an tih avângin a mangang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Herodan, “Johana chu a lû ka tan tawh kha; nimahsela, heti kauva a thu ka hriat ṭhina hi tu nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, amah chu hmuh a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte chu an lo hâwn lehin, a hnênah an thiltihte an hrilh a. Tin, ani chu anmahni hruaiin, Bethsaida khua an tihah chuan a kal hrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, mipuiho chuan an hria a, an zui zêl a; tin, ani chuan anni chu a lo lâwm a, Pathian ram thu a hrilh a, tihdam ngai apiang a tidam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, khua chu a lo tlai dâwn ta a; tin, sâwm leh pahnihte chu an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Kan kiang vêl khuaahte leh lovahte kalin, thlen in leh ei tûr an hmuh theihna tûrin mipui hi kaltîr ta che; hei, thlalêr hmuna awm kan ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an hnênah, “Nangmahnin ei tûr pe rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Hêng mi zawng zawng tân hian ei tûr kan va leisak loh chuan, chhangpêr panga leh sangha pahnih chauh lo chu eng mah kan nei lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />(Patling hlîr pawh sângnga emaw lai an ni si a.) Tin, a zirtîrte hnênah, “A pâwl pâwlin ṭhuttîr rawh u, sawmnga vêl zêlin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an ti a, an ṭhuttîr ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chhangpêr panga leh sangha pahnih chu a la a, vân lam enin mal a sâwm a, a phel a, mipui hmaa hlui tûrin a zirtîrte hnênah chuan a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an ei a, an puar ta vek a; tin, an ei bângnawi chu bâwmrâng sâwm leh pahnih an rût khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isua amah chauhva a ṭawngṭai laiin a zirtîrte chu a hnênah an awm a; an hnênah, “Mipuiten tu nge a ni mi tih?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “ ‘Baptistu Johana a ni,’ an ti chia; nimahsela, ṭhenkhat erawh chuan, ‘Elija a ni,’ an ti chia; ṭhenkhatin, ‘Hmânlai zâwlnei tua emaw a tho leh ta a ni,’ an ti che,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “ A nih leh, nangnin tu nge a ni mi tih?” a ti a. Tin, Peteran, “Pathian Krista chu,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi thu chu tu mah hrilh loh tûr ti tlatin thu a pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihring Fapa hian thil tam tak a tuar tûr a ni a, upate, puithiam lalte, lehkhaziaktute duh lohvin a awm tûr a ni a, thahin a awm tûr a ni a, ni thum nîah kaihthawhin a awm bawk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin mi zawng zawng hnênah, “Tu pawhin mi zui a duh chuan, mahni hrehawm pawisa lovin, ni tin a kraws puin mi zui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu pawh a nun humhim duh apiangin a chân ang a; tu pawh keimah avânga a nun chân apiangin, chu mi ngei chuan a humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Miin khawvêl hi a pumin nei sela, intiboralin emaw intichhe si sela, a tân eng nge sâwt ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu pawh keimah leh ka thu zahpui apiang, Mihring Fapa hian ama ropuina nên, a Pa ropuina nên, a vântirhkoh thianghlimte ropuina nên a lo kal hunah chuan, chu mi chu a rawn zahpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dik takin ka hrilh a che u, heta dingho a ṭhente hi, Pathian ram an hmuh hma loh chuan thihna tem tawp lo tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng thusawi achin ni riat emaw laiah, Isuan Petera te, Johana te, Jakoba te chu a hruai a, ṭawngṭai tûrin tlângah a kal chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a ṭawngṭai laiin a hmêl awmzia chu a lo danglam a, a silhfênte chu a lo vâr a, mi ênkhalh theiin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi pahnih amah nên an inbia a, chu mite chu Mosia leh Elija an ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ropuinaa inthuamin an inlâr a, Jerusalem khuaa a thih tleitlâkna tûr thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Petera leh a ṭhiante erawh chu an muthlu a; tin, an harh veleh a ropuizia leh a hnêna mi pahnih ding chu an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chu mite chuan Isua an ṭhen dâwn laiin, Peteran Isua hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, kan tân heta awm hi a ṭha e; bâwktê pathum kan khawh ang e; i tân pakhat, Mosia tân pakhat, Elija tân pakhat,” a ti a - a thusawi pawh hre lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu a sawi laiin chhûm a lo zîng a, anmahni a hliah ta a; chhûmah chuan an luh laiin an hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, chhûmah chuan aw a lo chhuak a, “Hei hi ka Fapa, ka thlana chu a ni, ama thu ngai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, aw chu a reh veleh Isua chu amah chauhvin an hmu ta a. Tin, an ngawi reng a, chûng lai vêl chuan an thil hmuh chu tu mah eng mah an hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a tûkah tlâng ata chu an chhuk hnu chuan, mipui tam takin amah chu an lo hmuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mipui zîngah chuan mi pakhat a au va, “Zirtîrtu, ka fapa en tûrin ka ngên a che, ka fapa neih chhun a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ngai teh, ramhuaiin a man ṭhîn a, a au chhuak thut ṭhîn; tichuan, a chilphuante tla khawpin a sawisa ṭhîn a, nasa taka tihthitlinin a kalsan ṭâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, i zirtîrte hnênah hnawt chhuak tûrin ka ngên a; an thei si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Ṭhangthar rinna nei lova tihmawhte u, eng chen nge in hnênah ka awm anga, ka ngaihtheih ang che u? I fapa chu hetah rawn hruai rawh,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, a lo kal laiin ramhuai chuan a titlu vak a, nasa takin a sawisa ta a. Nimahsela, Isuan ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu a hau va, naupang chu a tidam a, a pa hnênah chuan a kaltîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng chuan Pathian ropuizia chu mak an ti hle a. Chutichuan, mi zawng zawngin a thiltih zawng zawng chu mak an tih lai chuan Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Hêng thu hi in bengah lût rawh se: Mihring Fapa hi mihringte kutah mantîrin a awm dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nimahsela, a thusawi chu a ngaihna an hre lo va, an hriat theih loh nân a inthup a ni, a thusawi chu amah lah an zâwt ngam si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, “Kan zîngah tu nge ropui ber ang?” tiin an lo inhnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan an rilrua an ngaihtuah chu a hria a, naupang tê a kai a, a sîrah a dintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />an hnênah, “Tu pawh ka hming avânga he naupang tê hi lâwm apiang chu keimah mi lâwm an ni ang; tu pawh kei mi lâwm apiang chu mi tîrtu lâwm an ni ang; in zavaia zînga tê ber hi a ni ropui ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Johana chuan, “Zirtîrtu, tu emaw i hminga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak kan hmu a, kan zuinaah che a tel ve loh avângin kan khap ta asin le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a hnênah, “Khap tawh suh u; tu pawh nangni dodâl lo chu in lama ṭang an ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, amah hruai chhoh a hun dâwnin, Jerusalem khuaa kal tumin a hawi tlat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />a hmaah lamkalte a tîr a; tin, an kal a, amah lo buatsaihsak tûrin Samari mite khaw pakhatah an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, a mitmei chu Jerusalem khaw lam pana a lan avângin amah an lo lâwm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tichuan, a zirtîr Jakoba leh Johana chuan chu chu an hriat veleh, “Lalpa, hêngho kan vek nân hian vân ata mei ko thla ila rem i ti em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a lehhawi a, a kamkhat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, khaw dangah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, kalkawnga an kal laiin tuin emaw a hnênah, “I kalna apiangah ka zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Sihalten kua an nei a, chunglêng savate pawhin bu an nei a, Mihring Fapa erawh hi chuan a lû nghahna a nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, mi dang hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a. Nimahsela, ani chuan, “Lalpa, ka pa mi vuitîr zet rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan a hnênah, “Mitthiin anmahni mitthi chu vui rawh se; nang chuan Pathian ram thu va hril darh zâwk rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, mi dang pawhin, “Lalpa, ka zui ang che; amaherawhchu, ka ina mite ṭawng ṭhain mi thlahtîr zet rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Tu pawh leilehnaa kut nghata hnung lam en chu, Pathian ram mi ni tlâk a ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi zawhah chuan Lalpan mi dang sawmsarih a ruat a, a kalna tûr khaw tinah leh hmun tinah, a hmaah pahnih zêlin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Buh seng tûr a tam hle a; nimahsela, a thawktute an tlêm; chutichuan, a buh seng tûra thawktu tûrte tîr tûrin buh Neitupa hnênah chuan ngên rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kal rawh u; ngai teh u, chinghne zînga berâmno awm angin ka tirh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangka ip te, iptê te, pheikhawk te keng suh ula, kalkawngah tu mah chibai bûk suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, in luhna in apiangah a hmasa berin, ‘He inah hian thlamuanna thleng rawh se,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan thlamuanna fa a awm chuan, in thlamuanna thu chu a chungah a awm reng ang; a awm loh erawh chuan in chungah a lo kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi inah chuan awm reng ula, an pêk apiang che u eiin bâr ang che u; hnathawktu chu hlawh hmu tlâk a ni a. In tinah kal lâwr suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, khua in luhna apiangah an lawm che u chuan, an hlui apiang che u chu ei ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />an khuaa damlo awmte pawh tidam ula, an hnênah, ‘Pathian ram in kiangah a lo thleng ta,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khua in luhna apiangah an lawm loh che u erawh chuan, an kawtthlêrahte kal chhuak ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘In khaw vaivut kan kephaha kai pawh hi in chungah kan tah fai hi; nimahsela, Pathian ram in kiangah a lo thleng ta tih hi hre rawh u,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ti a che u, chumi nîah chuan chumi khuate tuar tûr ai chuan Sodom khaw tuar tûr chu a zia a awm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Korazin, i chung a pik e! Bethsaida, i chung a pik e! Nangmahnia thilmak tak tihte kha Tura leh Sidon khuaa tih ni sela, saiip puan sina vut zînga ṭhuin an sim daih tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, ngaihtuah nîah chuan nangni tuar tûr ai chuan Tura leh Sidon khaw tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, nang Kapernaum, vân thlengin chawimawi i ni dâwn em ni? Mitthi khaw thlenga nam thlâk asin i nih dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu pawh nangni thu ngai chu keima thu ngai a ni e; tu pawh a duh lo che u chu kei mi duh lo a ni e; tu pawh kei mi duh lo chu mi tîrtu duh lo a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, sawmsarihte chu lâwm takin an lo hâwng a, “Lalpa, ramhuaite pawh i hming avângin kan thû thûin an awm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ṭêk anga Setana vân aṭanga a lo tla kha ka hmu asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh u, rûlte, khawmualkaikuangte rah theihna thu ka pe che u a; eng mahin a tina tawp lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, ramhuaite in thû thûa an awm avâng hian lâwm suh u; vâna in hming ziak a nih avângin lâwm zâwk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai tak chuan Isua chu Thlarau Thianghlimah a lâwm êm êm a, “Aw ka Pa, lei leh vân Lalpa, nangin mi fing leh mi bengvârte hnênah hêng thu hi i zêpa, nausênte hnêna i puan avâng hian ka fak a che; a ni, ka Pa, chutiang tih chu i ngaihin a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka Pain engkim mi kawltîr tawh, Fapa chu tu nge a nih, Pa lo chuan tu mân an hre lo; Pa pawh chu tu nge a nih, Fapa leh an hnêna Fapain a puan duhnate chauh lo chuan tu mân an hre lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte lam a hawi a, a rûkin, “In thil hmuhte hi a hmuhna mitte chu a vânnei e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka ti a che u, zâwlnei tam tak leh lal tam takte pawhin in thil hmuhte hi hmuh an châk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, an hmu si lo; benga in hriatte pawh hi hriat an châk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, an hre si lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, dân hretu tu emaw a ding a, amah fiah nân, “Zirtîrtu, chatuana nun neihna tûrin engtin nge ka tih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Dân lehkhabuah eng nge inziak ni? Chutah chuan eng nge i chhiar ṭhin?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian chu i thinlung zawng zawngin, i thlarau zawng zawngin, i chakna zawng zawngin, i rilru zawng zawngin i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ ‘Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte pawh i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “I chhâng dik zet mai e; chutiang chuan ti la, i nung ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan thiam inchantîr a tum a, Isua hnênah, “A nih leh, ka vêngte chu tute nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Tu emaw Jerusalem khua aṭangin Jeriko khuaah a zuk kal dâwn a, suamhmangte a tâwk hlauh va, chu mite chuan a silhfên an hlihsak vek a, an vaw nek a, thi lek lekin an kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, puithiam tu emaw chumi kawngah chuan a zuk kal kher a, a hmuh veleh kawng sîr lehlamah a hêl ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, chutiang bawkin Levia chi mi pakhat pawhin, chumi hmun chu a lo thleng a, a hmuh veleh kawngsîr lehlamah a hêl ve ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Samari rama mi tu emaw a zin kalin a awmna chu a lo thleng a, a hmuh veleh a khawngaih êm êm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a hnênah a va kal a, a pemahte chuan hriak leh uain a leih a, a tuam a, ama sa chungah a chuantîr a, khual bûkah a kalpui a, a enkawl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan duli pahnih a phawrh a, khual bûk vêngtu hnênah a pe a, ‘Lo enkawl la, hemi bâka i sên zawng chu ka lo kîr leh hunah ka rawn rûl leh ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chu mite pathum zîngah chuan, suam hmangho tâwka vêngte chu tu ber nge nia i rin?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “A khawngaihtu chu,” a ti a. Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Nang pawh chu ang bawk chuan va ti ve rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, an zin pahin khaw engah emaw a lût a; tin, hmeichhe pakhat a hming Marthiin a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chu mi chuan laizâwn pakhat a nei a, a hming chu Mari a ni a, chu mi chu Lalpa ke bulah a ṭhu a, a thu a ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Marthi erawh chu rawngbâwl ngawtin a buai hle a; tichuan, a hnênah a lo kal a, “Lalpa, ka laizâwnnun keimah chauh rawngbâwl tûra mi thlahthlam hi pawi i ti lo vem ni? Mi pui tûrin ti rawh khai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan, “Marthi, Marthi, thil tam tak i ngaihtuah a, i buai a nih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />thil pakhat chauh a pawimawh e: Marin chan ṭha chu a thlang a, chu chu lâk sak tûr a ni lo ve,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Isua khawii hmunah emaw a ṭawngṭai a, a ṭawngṭai zawh chuan a zirtîr pakhatin a hnênah, “Lalpa, ṭawngṭai dân Johanan a zirtîrte a zirtîr ang khân min zirtîr ve ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “In ṭawngṭai chuan heti hian ti ang che u, ‘Kan Pa, I hming zahawm rawh se. I ram lo thleng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni tin kan ei khawpin chaw min pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan sualte min ngaidam ang che, Keini pawhin kan englo bâte zawng zawng kan ngaidam ṭhîn a ni. Thlêmnaah min hruai lût suh ang che,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, amah vêkin an hnênah, “In zîngan tuin emaw ṭhian nei sela, zanlaiah a hnêna kalin, ‘ṭhiana, chhangpêr pathum mi pûktîr rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ka ṭhian zinin mi rawn tlawh a, a hmaa hlui tûr eng mah ka nei si lo,’ ti sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in chhûnga miin, ‘Mi tibuai suh; tûnah zawng kawng khâr a ni a, ka fate pawh ka hnênah khumah an mu tawh a; thovin ka va pe thei lo va che,’ tiin chhâng sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka ti a che u, a ṭhian a nih avângin thovin a va pe lo na a, a dîl ngut ngut avângin thovin a duh zât apiang a va pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka ti a che u, dîl rawh u; tichuan, an pe ang che u; zawng rawh u; tichuan in hmu ang; kik rawh u; tichuan, an hawnsak ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawh a dîl apiang chuan an hmu ṭhîn a, tu pawh a zawng chuan an hmu ṭhîn a, tu pawh a kik chu an hawnsak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangniho zînga pa hi, a fapain chhangpêr dîl sela, tu nge lung pe ang? A nih leh, sangha dîl sela, tu nge sangha aiah rûl pe ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nih leh, artui dîl sela, khawmualkaikuang a pe ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangni mi sual mahin in fate thil ṭha pêk nachâng in hriat chuan, in Pa vâna mi chuan a dîltute chu Thlarau Thianghlim a va pe dâwn êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isuan ramhuai ṭawngtheilo pakhat a hnawt chhuak a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, ramhuai chu a chhuah veleh ṭawngtheilova chu a lo ṭawng ta a; tichuan, mipui chuan mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, a ṭhen chuan, “Ramhuai lal Beelzebula avângin alâwm ramhuaite a hnawh chhuah ṭhin ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhenin amah fiah nân vân ata chhinchhiahna an dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan an ngaihtuahte chu a lo hria a, an hnênah, “Khawii ram pawh mahni indo apiang an boral ṭhîn; chhûngkhat pawh mahni indo chu an boral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Setana pawh mahni a indo chuan, a ram engtin nge a din chhuah ang? ‘Beelzebula avângin ramhuaite a hnawt chhuak,’ mi ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, kei hi Beelzebula avânga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ṭhîn ka lo nih chuan, in faten tu vângin nge an lo hnawh chhuah ṭhin le? Chuvângin, anni chu nangmahni ngaihtuahtu tûrte an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, kei hian Pathian kutzung avânga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak ṭhîn ka nih chuan, Pathian ram in hnênah a lo thleng tawh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi chak chuan hriam famkim kenga a in a vên chhûng zawng, a sum chu him takin a awm reng ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nimahsela, a aia chak zâwkin a rawn beiha, a hneh hun chuan a inrinna râlthuam famkim chu a chhuhsak a, a sum a lâksak chu a sem darh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh ka lama ṭang lo chu mi do a ni; tu pawh mi lâk khâwmpui lo chuan a tidarh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ramhuai bawlhhlawh chu, mi kawchhûng ata a chhuahin, chawlhna zawngin tui awm lohna hmunahte a vâk a vâk ṭhîn a; tin, chawlhna rêng rêng a hmu lo va, ‘Ka chhuahna inah khân ka kîr leh mai ang,’ a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tin, a va thlen chuan phiah faia chei mawiin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu veleh a va kal a, amah aia sual zâwk ramhuai dang pasarih a rawn hruai a, chutah chuan an lût a, an awm reng ṭhîn a; chu mihringa awmze hnuhnûng chu a hmasa aiin a lo ṭha lo zâwk ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng thûte chu a sawi laiin, mipui zîngan hmeichhia tu emaw a lo au chhuak a, a hnênah, “I paina pum chu a hamṭha e, i hnute hnêk pawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “A ni; nimahsela Pathian thu hriaa zâwmte hi mi hamṭha an ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mipuite chu a hnêna an rawn inkhâwm laiin Isuan, “Tûnlai chhuante hi chhuan sual an ni; chhinchhiahna an zawng a; nimahsela, Jona chhinchhiahna chauh lo chu an hnênah chhinchhiahna rêng rêng pêk a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jona chu Ninevi khuaa mite tân chhinchhiahna a lo ni ang khân, Mihring Fapa pawh tûnlai chhuante tân hian chhinchhiahna a la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chhim lam lalnu kha, ngaihtuah hunah chuan tûnlai chhuante hnênah hian a tho ve ang a, thiam loh a chantîr ang; Solomona fin ngaithla tûr mahin kâwlkil ata a lo kal si a; ngai teh u, Solomona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ninevi khuaa mite chu, ngaihtuah hunah chuan, tûnlai chhuante hnênah hian an ding ve ang a, thiam loh an chantîr ang, Jona thuhril avângin an sim si a; ngai teh u, Jona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu mân khâwnvâr an hâlin in hnuai pûkah an dah ngai lo, hrai hnuaiah an dah ngai hek lo, mi lûtte chuan a êng an hmuh theih nân, a dahnaah chuan an dah zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I taksa khâwnvâr chu i mit a ni; i mit a fîm chuan i taksa pawh a pumin a êng chhuak ṭhîn; a chhiat erawh chuan i taksa pawh a thim zo vek ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, i chhûnga êng awm chu thim a lo ni dah law maw, fîmkhur rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, taksa hi khawi lai mah thim lova a puma a ên chhuah chuan, khâwnvâr êng nasa takin a ên che angin a êng chhuak vek ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a sawi laiin Pharisai pakhatin amah chu a hnêna chaw eiah a sâwm a; tichuan, a lût a, chaw a kîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Pharisai chuan a chaw kîl chu a hmuhin, chaw ei hmaa kut a sil lo chu mak a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Nangni Pharisaite chuan no leh thlêng pâwn lam chu in sil fai ṭhîn tak a; in kawchhûng lam erawh chu hlêprûk leh sualin a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi âte u, pâwn lam siamtuin chhûng lam pawh a siam lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nimahsela, a chhûnga thil awm chu mi rethei hnêna pêk atân hmang rawh u; tichuan, ngai teh u, in tân engkim a thianghlim tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nangni Pharisaite u, in chung a pik e! Pudina te, pârdi te, thlai tinrêng te sâwma pakhat in pe ṭhîn a, felna leh Pathian hmangaihna chu in ngaihthah si ṭhîn; nimahsela, chûng chu asin in tih tûr ni, a dangte chu tih ṭhulh chuang lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nangni Pharisaite u, in chung a pik e! Inkhâwmna inah ṭhutphah tha berte leh, dâwr hmuna chibai bûkte in ngaina si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />In chung a pik e! Thlân tih hriat loh, a chunga hre lova mi an kal ṭhinna ang chu in ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, dân hretu pakhatin a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, hêng thu i sawi hi keini pawh min hau i nih hi,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Dân hretute u, nangni pawh in chung a pik e! Thil phurh hrehawm takte mite in bel ṭhîn a, nangni chuan phurte chu in kut zungṭang pakhat pawhin in khawih ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />In chung a pik e! Zâwlneiho thlân inte in sa ṭhîn a, in thlahtute thah an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chutichuan, in thlahtute thiltihte chu in hriatpuiin in remtihpui a ni; annin an that a, nangnin an thlân inte in sa si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathian finna pawhin, ‘An hnênah zâwlneite leh tirhkohte ka tîr ang a, a ṭhen an that ang a, a ṭhen an tiduhdah ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />chutichuan, Abela thisen chhuah achin Zakaria, maichâm leh biak in inkâra thia thisen chhuak thleng khân, zâwlnei zawng zawng thisen leilung pian tirh ata chhuak chu, tûnlai chhuante chungah hian phuba an la thei ang,’ a tih kha. A ni, ka hrilh a che u, tûnlai chhuante chungah hian phuba an la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nangni dân hretute u, in chung a pik e! Finna chabi chu in kal bopui a; nangni lah in lût si lo va, mi lût tûrte pawh in khap si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, chuta ta a chhuah chuan, lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaite chuan amah chu an tai ta rân a, thu tinrêng an sawi luihtîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />a ṭawng sual hlauhva man tumin an châng reng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih chhûnga mipui sâng tam tak, inrap nûlh nûlh khawp hial an rawn inkhâwm chuan, Isuan a hmasa berin a zirtîrte hnênah, “Pharisaite dawidim, vervêkna lakah chuan fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lang lo tûra thuhrûk eng mah a awm lo va, hriat loh tûra zêp rûk eng mah a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, thima in sawi apiang kha êngah an la hria ang a; pindan chhûngrila beng bula in thusawi kha, in chunga chuangin an la tlângaupui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ka ṭhiante u, ka hrilh a che u, taksa tihluma, chumi hnua eng mah dang ti leh thei tawh lote chu hlau suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu nge in hlauh tûr ka hrilh lâwk ang che u: a tihhlum hnu pawha Gehenna-a paih theihna thu neia chu hlau rawh u; a ni, ka hrilh a che u, amah mawlh chu hlau rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chawngzawng panga dâr tangka pahnihin an hralh ṭhîn lo vem ni? Nimahsela, an zînga pakhat mah Pathianin a hmaih ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In samzaite lam pawh hi chhiar vek a ni asin. Hlau suh u; chawngzawng tam tak aiin in hlu zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka hrilh a che u, mite hmaa mi ṭan apiang, Pathian vântirhkohte hmaah Mihring Fapain a ṭan ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, mite hmaa mi phat chu, Pathian vântirhkohte hmaah phat a ni ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Mihring Fapa sawisêl apiang chu, an sawisêlna chu ngaihdamsak a ni ang; Thlarau Thianghlim meuh sawi chhia erawh chu, a sawichhiatna chu ngaihdamsak a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, inkhâwmna ina mite, lalte, hotute hmaa an hruai hunah che u chuan, ‘Engtin nge, eng thuin nge ka chhân ang, eng thu nge ka sawi ang?’ tiin lungkham suh ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />chutih hun takah chuan eng nge in sawi tûr rem, Thlarau Thianghlimin a hrilh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipui zînga tu emawin Isua hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, ka u hnênah ro mi sem ve tûrin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan a hnênah, “Mihring, nangni chungah tuin nge rorêltuah leh sum semtuah mi siam?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Fîmkhur ula, awhna rêng rêng lakah chuan invêng rawh u; sum ngah hi mihring dam chhan a ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi a: “Mi hausa tu emaw a lo a hlâwk êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tichuan, a inngaihtuah a, ‘Engtin nge ka tih ang aw? Ka buh leh bâl dah khâwmna ka nei si lo va,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ‘Heti hian ka ti teh ang: ka buh inte ka ṭhiat ang a, a aia lianin ka sa ang a; chutah chuan ka buh leh ka sum zawng zawng ka dah khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ka thlarau hnênah, “Thlarau, kum tam tak chhûng atân sum tam tak i khâwl hi; châwl la, eiin bâr la, hlim takin awm rawh,” ka ti ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin a hnênah, ‘Mi â, zâninah hian i thlarau an lâksak dâwn che a ni; i thil deh chhuahte kha tu ta nge ni ta ang le?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahni tâna sum khâwla, Pathian lama ngah si lo chu, chuti chu a ni ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte hnênah, “Chuvângin, ka hrilh a che u, ‘Eng nge ka ei ang aw?’ tiin in nunna thu leh, ‘Eng nge ka silhin ka fên ang aw?’ tiin in taksa thu lungkham suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ei tûr aiin nunna a thupui zâwk a ni, silhfên ai pawhin taksa a thupui zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Choâkte hi ngaihtuah rawh u, buh an tuh lo va, an ât hek lo; zêm te, buh in te pawh an nei lo; nimahsela, Pathianin a châwm si a; nangni chu savate ai chuan in hlut zâwkzia mai chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, nangni zîngah lungkham avângin tuin nge mahni dung lam tawng khata tisâng chuang thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hemi tê mah ti thei lo che ua, engati nge thil dang in lungkham ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tûktinpâr ṭhan zia hi ngaihtuah rawh u; hna an thawk lo, la pawh an kai hek lo; nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Solomona meuh pawh a ropuina zawng zawnga a inthuam khân, hêng tûktinpâr pakhat tluk pawh hian cheiin a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram hnim, vawiin anga nung, a tûka thuka tuah leh mai tûr mah Pathianin chuti kauva a chei chuan, aw, nangni rin tlêmte u, chumi ai chuan silhfên a va pe dâwn che u êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, in ei tûr te, in in tûr te zawng suh u; tuilairap angin awm pawh awm suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khawvêla hnam tinin chûng thil zawng zawng chu an zawng ṭhîn a ni; chûng chu in mamawh tih in Pain a hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama ram zawng zâwk rawh u; tichuan, chûng thil pawh chu a pêk belhchhah dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pâwl tlêmte u, hlau suh u; ram pêk che u hi in Pa lâwm zâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In neih apiang hralh ula, mi retheite hnênah pe rawh u; vânah rûkru kal lohnaah, sûlrûl ei chhiat lohnaah chuan tangka ip hlui thei lo te, sum ral thei lo te insiam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In ro awmna apiangah in rilru pawh a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puan veng rengin, in khâwnvâr pawh alh rengin awm ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />miin an pu lawi chaw ei, a lo haw huna kawngkhâr a rawn kik veleha lo hawn thei nghâl tûra an lo nghâk reng ang hian awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An pu a lo kal hunah bâwih lo nghâk reng a hmuhate chu an eng a thâwl ang; tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, ani chuan a puan a rawn veng ang a, anmahni chu chaw kîlin a ṭhuttîr ang a, an rawng a rawn bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zanlaiah emaw, thawh hunah emaw a lo kala, chutianga a rawn hmuh chuan chûng bâwihte chu an eng a thâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hei hi hre rawh u, rûkru a lo kal hun tûr in neituin hria sela, a vêng ang a, a in a reh pawhtîr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangni pawh inring rengin awm rawh u, in rin loh hunah Mihring Fapa a lo kal dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Peteran, “Lalpa, he tehkhin thu hi keimahni chauh nge min hrilh, mi zawng zawng?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan, “Sum enkawltu rinawm, fing tak, a puin a hun apianga an chaw chan tûr semsak tûrin, a chhûngte chunga hotua a siam tûr chu tu ber nge ni ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A pu a lo kal hunah bâwih chutiang tia a rawn hmuha chu a eng a thâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Dik takin ka hrilh a che u, a neih zawng zawng chunga hotuah a siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chu bâwih chuan a rilruin, ‘Ka pu a lo kal lawk dâwn lo ve,’ tiin bâwihnute, bâwihpate lo vêl sela, eiin bârin lo rui ta sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />chu bâwiha pu chu a rin loh nîah, a hriat loh laiin a lo kal ang a, bung hnihah a rawn chhuah ang a, mi rinawm lote chan ang a chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Bâwih, a pu duh zâwng hre reng chunga lo inring si lova, a pu duh zâwng ang pawha ti lo chu vawi tam tak an vua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hre lo chunga vuakna khawp thil ti chu vawi tlêm tê an vua ang. Tu pawh tam tak an pêka hnênah chuan tam tak an phût ang, tu pawh tam tak an kawltîra hnênah chuan tam deuh an phût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Khawvêlah mei thlâk thla tûra lo kal ka ni; tûnah pawh kâng tawh pang sela ka va ti êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nimahsela, baptisma chan tûr ka nei, chumi tleitlâk hma loh chu ka thaw a va ipik êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Khawvêla rem lêntîra lo kal emaw mi ti elo? Hnai lo ve, ka hrilh a che u, do lentîr tûra lo kal zâwk ka ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />tûn hnuah chuan chhûng khatah mi panga an indo vang, pathumin pahnih, pahnihin pathum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />An indo vang a, pain a fapa, fapain a pa; nuin a fanu, fanuin a nu; piin a mo, movin a pi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, mipui hnênah pawh chuan, “Thlang lama chhûm chhuak in hmuh chuan, ‘Ruah a sûr dâwn,’ in ti nghâl ṭhîn a; tin, a lo ni ngei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, chhim thli tleh in hriat chuan, ‘Thaw a sa dâwn e,’ in ti ṭhîn a; tin, a lo ni ngei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nangni vervêkte u, khawvêl leh vân awmzia pawh in hre fiah thiam si a, engati nge tûnlai thil hi in hriat fiah thiam loh hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Engati nge nangmahnin a fel chu in ngaihtuah loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tin, rorêltu hmaa i khingpui nên in kal hunin, kal pahin a lakah fihlîmna mawlh zawng hrâm rawh; chuti lo chuan, rorêltu chuan mi man hotu a mantîr ang chia, mi man hotu chuan tân inah a khung hlauh dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che, dâr tangka derê tê pawh i tlâk kim hma loh chuan chuta ta chu i chhuak lo hul hual ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai tak chuan tute emaw an lo awm a, chu mite chuan Galili rama mi, Pilatan an thisen an pathian biakna sa talhte zînga a telhsakate chanchin chu Isua an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chu Galili rama mite chu, chutiang thil an tuar avâng chuan, Galili rama mi zawng zawng aiin mi sual bîk niin in ring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni suh e, ka hrilh a che u, nangni pawh in sim loh chuan chutiang bawkin in boral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Siloam in sângin mi sâwm leh pariat a delh hlumte pawh kha, Jerusalem khuaa awmte zawng zawng aiin mi sual bîk niin in ring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni suh e, ka hrilh a che u, nangni pawh in sim loh chuan chutiang bawkin in boral vek ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, he tehkhin thu hi a sawi a: “Tuin emaw a grêp huanah theipui kûng pakhat a nei a; tin, a kûngah chuan a rah a rawn zawng a, pakhat mah a hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, grêp hrui enkawltu hnênah, ‘Ngai rawh, kum thum chhûng hian he theipui kûngah hian a rah ka va zawng ṭhîn a, pakhat mah ka hmu si lo; kit rawh; engati nge hmun pawh awha a awm reng ni?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘Ka pu, kumin tal hi awm sela, a vêlin ka lai ang a, leiṭha ka vûr rih ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chumi hnua a rah chuan a ṭha ang a, a rah loh erawh chuan kit mai ang che,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhniah ani chuan inkhâwmna in pakhatah a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, kum sâwm leh kum riat, ramhuai man, chak loh vei hmeichhe pakhat a awm; chu mi chu a kûn reng a, amah chuan a ding ngîl thei tawp lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hmuh veleh a ko va, a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, i chak lohna chuan a thlah ta a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a chungah a kut a nghat a; tichuan, thawklehkhatan a ngîl ta nghâl a, Pathian a fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isuan Chawlhnia mi a tihdam avângin inkhâwmna in hotu chu a thinur a, mipui chu a bia a, an hnênah, “Mihring hnathawhna tûr ni ruk a awm alâwm; chumi chhûng chuan lo kal ula, intidam rawh u, Chawlhnia lo kal lovin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chuan a hnênah, “Nangni vervêkte u, Chawlhniah mahni sebâwng emaw, sabengtung emaw a chaw eina ata phelhin, tui in tûrin in hruai chhuak ṭheuh ṭhîn a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />He hmeichhia hi Abrahama fanu a ni si a, ngai teh u, Setanan kum sâwm leh kum riat a man reng hi, Chawlhniah pawh hemi phuar hi han phelhsak lohzia em ni?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng thu a sawi lai chuan a hmêlmate zawng zawng chu an zak ta a; mipui erawh chu a thil ropui tih zawng zawng avâng chuan an lâwm vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan, “Pathian ram chu eng ang nge ni? Eng nên nge teh pawh ka tehkhin ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anṭam chi fang khat miin a lâka, a huana a theha ang chu a ni; chu chu a lo ṭo va, thing a lo ni a, chunglêng savate chu a zârahte chuan an riak a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, “Pathian ram chu eng nên nge ka tehkhin ang?” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Dawidim hmeichhiain a lâka, chhangphut tehkhâwng thum zîngah, a zaa a thawh vek thlenga a phûma ang chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan zirtîr chung zêla Jerusalem khaw lam panin, khaw lian leh khaw tête a tlawh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, tuin emaw a hnênah, “Chhandamte chu tlêm tê em an nih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Kawngka zîmah chuan luh tum hrâm rawh u; ka hrilh a che u, mi tam takin luh an tum ang a, an lût thei si lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In neitu a thawha, kawng a khâr hnu chuan nangnin pâwna dingin, ‘Lalpa, kawng min hawnsak rawh,’ tia, kawngkhâr in rawn kik hunah, anin, ‘Khawii lama mi nge in nih ka hre lo a che u,’ tiin a chhâng ang che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chutih hunah chuan nangnin, ‘I hmuhah pawh kan eiin kan bâr tawh kha, kan kawtthlêrahte pawh i zirtîr ṭhin kha,’ in la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, anin, ‘Ka hrilh a che u, khawii lama mi nge in nih ka hre lo; nangni thil sual ti zawng zawngte u, ka hnên ata kal bo vek rawh u,’ a la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abrahama te, Isaaka te, Jakoba te, zâwlnei zawng zawngte chu Pathian ram chhûnga awm in hmuha, nangni pâwna hnawh chhuah in nih in inhriat hunah, chutah chuan ṭah leh ha ṭhial chu a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chhak leh thlang, chhim leh hmâr aṭangin an lo kal ang a, Pathian ramah an lo ṭhu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, hnuhnûng berte pawh hmasa bera awm tûr an awm a, hmasa berte pawh hnuhnûng bera awm tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutih lai tak chuan Pharisai tute emaw an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Chhuak la, heta ta hi kal bo rawh; Herodan tihhlum che a duh êm êm a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chu sihal hnênah chuan he thu hi va sawi rawh u: ‘Ngai rawh, vawiinah nên, naktûkah nên ramhuaite ka hnawt chhuak ang a, nâte pawh ka tidam ang a, a tûk lehah ka zo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Eng pawh ni rawh se, vawiinah nên, naktûkah nên, a tûk lehah nên ka kal zêl tûr a ni; Jerusalem khaw pâwn lamah zâwlnei thih theih a ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Aw Jerusalem, Jerusalem! zâwlneiho thattu, i hnêna an rawn tirhte lunga lo dêng hlumtu! Arpuiin mahni notê a thla hnuaia a awp khâwm angin, i fate vawi eng zât nge awp khâwm ka tum kha! Nimahsela, in duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />En teh u, in in chu a ruaka hnutchhiah che uin a awm ta. Ka hrilh a che u, ‘Lalpa hminga lo kal chu a eng a thâwl e,’ in tih hma loh chuan mi hmu leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Chawlhniah Pharisai hotu pakhat ina chaw ei tûra a kal chu an enthla reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, a hmaah chuan damlo vûng mi tu emaw a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan dân hretute leh Pharisaite chu a bia a, an hnênah, “Chawlhniin tihdam a thiang nge thiang lo?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni erawh chu an ngawi reng a. Tin, ani chuan damlo chu a chelh a, a tidam a, a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Nangni zîngan in sabengtung emaw, sebâwng emaw tuichhunchhuahah tla sela, Chawlhni pawhin tu nge hnûk chhuak nghâl lo vang che u?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an chhâng thei lo leh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an mi sâwmten ṭhutphah ṭha ber an thlan ṭhinzia a hmu a, an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Lawi chaw ei tûrin tuin emaw a sâwm hunah che chuan, ṭhutphah ṭha berah ṭhu suh ang che; chuti lo chuan, i aia mi ṭha zâwk a lo sâwm hlauh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tichuan, a sâwmtu che chuan, ‘He mi ṭhutna tûr hi kian rawh,’ a rawn ti ang chia; tin, nang zak takin ṭhutphah ṭha lo berah i ṭhu leh si ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An sâwm hunah che chuan, ṭhutphah ṭha lo berah ṭhu zâwk ang che; chutichuan, a sâwmtu che a lo kal hunah i hnênah, ‘ṭhiana, ṭhutphah ṭha deuhvah ṭhu rawh,’ a ti thei ang che. Chutichuan, i chaw kîlpuite mit hmuhah chuan chawimawiin i awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inngaihlu apiang an tlâwm ang a; inngaitlâwm chu chawimawiin an awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a sâwmtu hnênah pawh chuan, “Chhûnah emaw, zânah emaw ruai i ṭheh hunin i ṭhiante, i unaute, i laichînte, i vêng hausate chu sâwm suh ang che; chuti lo chuan, an sâwm ve leh ang chia, an rûl leh kher ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruai i ṭheh hun chuan pachhiate, piangsualte, kebaite, mitdelte sâwm zâwk ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tichuan, chûng ang chuan rulhna tûr che an neih loh avângin i eng a thâwl ang; mi felte thawhleh hunah rulh leh i ni dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a chaw kîlpui tuin emaw chûng thu chu a hria a, a hnênah, “Pathian rama chaw ei tûr chu an eng a thâwl e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Mi tuin emaw zânah ruai ropui tak a ṭheh a, mi tam tak a sâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tin, a ei hun chuan a mi sâwmte hnênah, ‘Lo kal rawh u, tûnah engkim peih a ni ta e,’ ti tûrin a bâwih a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, an zain thu khat vuain chhuanlam an nei vek a. A hmasa berin a hnênah, ‘Lo ka lei ta a, a enin ka kal a ṭûl a ni; mi khawngaih la, mi han phatsak ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mi dangin, ‘Sebâwng tuak nga ka lei ta a, a chhia a ṭha fiahin ka kal dâwn a; mi khawngaih la, mi han phatsak ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mi dangin, ‘Nupui ka nei ta a; chuvângin, ka kal thei lo,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, bâwih chuan a pu hnênah chûng thu chu a va hrilh a. Tin, in neitu chu a thinur a, a bâwih hnênah chuan, ‘Chhuak la, kawthlêrahte, kâwmkârahte kal thuai thuai la, pachhiate, piangsualte, mitdelte, kebaite hetah rawn hruai lût rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, bâwih chuan, ‘Ka pu, i thu mi pêk ang khân ka ti tawh a; nimahsela, hmun a la chuang ta fo,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a pu chuan bâwih hnênah chuan, ‘Chhuak la, lamlianahte, daiahte kal la, ka in khah nân mi han thlêm lût hrâm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che, mi ka sâwmte khân pakhat mahin ka ruaiṭheh an ei lo vang,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, mipui tam tak a hnênah an kal ve a; tichuan, ani chu a hawi a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tu pawh ka hnêna lo kal chuan, a pa te, a nu te, a nupui te, a fa te, a unau te, a farnu te, ama nun nên lam pawh a huat loh chuan ka zirtîr a ni thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu pawh mahni kraws pua mi zui lo apiang chu ka zirtîr a ni thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nangni zîngah tu pawhin in sâng sak tum ula, a tîrah ṭhuin, sak zawhna khawp sum in neih leh neih loh hre tûrin, a man tûr chin tu nge chhût lo vang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuti lo chuan, lung phûm tawh zeta a sak zawh theih loh chuan, a en apiangin, ‘He mi hian in a rel ting a, a sa zo thei si lo,’ tiin an nuihsan dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, lal tuin nge lal dang do tûra a kal dâwnin, a tîrah ṭhuin, mi sînghnih nêna amah do tûra lo kal chu, mi sîngkhat nên a tawh ngam dâwn leh dâwn loh mi râwn lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuti a nih loh vêk leh, lal dang chu hla taka a la awm laiin, inremna lam thutiam dîl tûrin palai a tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni zîngah hian tu pawh, a neih zawng zawng kalsan lo apiang chu ka zirtîr a ni thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chi hi a ṭha e; nimahsela, chi pawh a dâk tawh chuan engin nge an tihal leh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lei tân a ṭha lo vang a, êk dûr tân pawh a ṭha hek lo vang; miin an paih chhuak ṭhîn. Tu pawh hriatna tûra beng nei chuan hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sual zawng zawngin a thu hre tûrin a kiang an rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite leh lehkhaziaktute chu, “He mi hian mi sualte a pâwl a, an hnênahte chaw a ei ve ṭhîn,” tiin an phunnawi ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, anin an hnênah he tehkhin thu hi a sawi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nangni zîngah tu pawhin berâm za nei ula, an zînga pakhat hloh ang ula, thlalêrah sawmkua leh pakuate chu hnutchhiahin, a bo chu in hmuh leh hma loh zawng tu nge zawng lo vang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, in hmuh leh chuan lâwm takin in kokiah in pu ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, in in thlen veleh in ṭhiante leh in vêngte in ko khâwm a, an hnênah, ‘Mi lâwmpui rawh u, ka berâm bo kha ka hmu leh ta e,’ in ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chutiang bawkin mi fel sawmkua leh pakua sim chuan tûr nei lote chungah ai chuan, mi sual pakhat sim chungah hian vâna mi an lâwm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia tu pawh duli sâwm neiin pakhat hloh ang sela, khâwnvâr hâla in phiatin, a hmuh leh hma loh zawng tu nge ngun takin zawng lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a hmuh leh chuan a ṭhiante leh a vêngte a ko khâwm a, ‘Mi lâwmpui rawh u, ka duli hloh kha ka hmu leh ta e,’ a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chutiang bawkin Pathian vântirhkohte hmaah chuan, mi sual pakhat sim chungah an lâwm ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, mi tuin emaw fapa pahnih a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, a naupang zâwk chuan a pa hnênah, ‘Ka pa, ro ka chan ai mi pe rawh,’ a ti a. Tichuan, a sum chu an hnênah a sem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ni rei lo tê chinah a fapa naupang zâwk chuan a chan ai zawng zawng chu a la khâwm vek a, khaw lamhla takah a kal ta a, chutah chuan nuam lutukin a awm a, a sum chu a khawh ral ta mai mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a deh ral zawh veleh, chu khaw lamah chuan ṭâm nasa tak mai a lo tla a; ei tûr a lo tlachham ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi khaw lam mi, mi pakhat a va bêl a; chu mi chuan vawk chaw pe tûrin a lo lamah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, englo kâwm vawkin an eite chuan intihpuar a duh êm êm a; tu mân eng mah an pe si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a inhriat chhuah veleh, ‘Ka pa hnêna inhlawhfate chaw ei sên loh va nei an tam vei nên, kei lah chu hetah rilṭâmin ka thi dâwn si a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tho vang a, ka pa hnênah ka kal ang a, a hnênah, “Ka pa, vâna mi chungah leh nangma mit hmuhin thil ka tisual e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />i fapaa vuah tlâk ka ni ta lo ve; i hnêna inhlawhfa pakhat angin mi siam ve rawh,” ka ti ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, a tho va, a pa hnênah a kal ta a. Chutichuan, hla taka a la awm laiin a pain a lo hmu a, a khawngaih êm êm a, a tlân a, a ir a chuktuah a, a fâwp ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah a fapain, ‘Ka pa, vâna mi chungah leh nangma mit hmuhin thil ka tisual e; i fapaa vuah tlâk ka ni ta lo ve,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, a pa chuan a bâwihte hnênah, ‘Puan ṭha ber kha han la thuai ula, han sintîr rawh u; a kutah zungbun te, a kephahah pheikhawk te buntîr rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />sebâwngno thau tak kha han la ula, talh rawh u, hlim takin i ei ang u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />he ka fapa hi a thi a, a lo nung leh ta a nih hi; a bo va, kan hmu leh ta a nih hi,’ a ti a. Tichuan, hlim takin an awm ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a fapa upa zâwk chu lovah a awm a; tin, in a lo thlen dâwn chuan englo tum ri leh lâm thâwm a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, chhiahhlawh pakhat a ko va, ‘Chu eng nge ni ta?’ tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘I nau a lo hâwng a, him taka a hmuh leh avângin i pain sebâwngno thau tak kha a talh a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, a thinur a, a lût duh ta lo va; tin, a pa chu a lo chhuak a, a thlêm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan a pa hnênah, ‘Ngai rawh, kumkhaw hei leh chen hi ka châwm chia, i thu lah hi ka âwih lo ngai si lo va; ka ṭhiante nêna hlimna ka siamna tûrin kêltê pawh mi pe ngai si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />nimahsela, hei i fapa, nawhchizuarte hnêna i sum ei ral vektu hi a lo haw veleh a tân sebâwngno thau tak kha i lo talh vei a,’ a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘Ka fapa, ka hnêna awm reng i ni alâwm, ka neih zawng zawng hi i ta a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hlim tak leh lâwm taka awm tûr a ni rêng alâwm; he i nau hi a thi a, a lo nung leh ta a; a bo va, kan hmu leh ta a ni si a,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah he thu pawh hi a sawi a: “Mi hausa tuin emaw sum enkawltu a nei a; chu mi chuan a sum a khawh ralsak mai mai kawngah a hnênah an hêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan amah chu a ko va, a hnênah, ‘I chungchâng thu ka hriat hi eng tizia nge ni? I sum enkawl chanchin mi ziah vek rawh; tûn achinah sum enkawltuah i ṭang thei tawh lo vang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, sum enkawltu chuan a rilruin, ‘Ka puin sum enkawltu aṭanga mi bân dâwn hi engtin nge ka tih ang aw? Lei laih ka peih si lo va, kut dawh lah chu ka zak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sum enkawla mi bân huna an ina mi awmtîr nân ka tih zia tûr ka hre ta,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, a pu sum batute chu a ko ṭheuh va, a hmasa ber hnênah chuan, ‘Ka pu lakah eng zât nge i bat?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Hriak tehkhâwng za,’ a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘I lehkha la la, ṭhu thuai la, sawmnga ziak rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mi dang hnênah, ‘Nang eng zât nge i bat?’ a ti a. Ani chuan, ‘Buh tehkhâwng za,’ a ti a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘I lehkha la la, sawmriat ziak rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a pu chuan sum enkawltu fel lo chu a remhriat avângin a fak ta a; êng fate aiin he khawvêl fate hi an tûnlai kawngah chuan an fing zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u. Sum lemin in tân ṭhiante siam rawh u; sum a boral huna chatuana awmnaah chuan an awmtîr nân che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawh tlêm te chunga rinawm chu tam tak chungah pawh a rinawm ṭhîn; tu pawh tlêm te chunga rinawm lo chu, tam tak chungah pawh a rinawm lo ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sum lem chungah mah in rinawm loh chuan, tuin nge sum tak chu kawltîr ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dang ta chungah mah in rinawm tawh loh chuan, nangmahni ta chu tuin nge pe ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh tu mahin hotu pahnih rawng an bâwl kawp thei lo; pakhat huain pakhat an duh ang, a nih loh leh, pakhat ṭanin pakhat an hmusit ang. Pathian leh sum rawng in bâwl kawp thei lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pharisai, tangka ngaihlute chuan chûng thu zawng zawng chu an hria a, an nuihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi mit hmuha intifel mai in ni e; nimahsela, Pathianin in rilru a hre si a; mihring zînga an chawimawi chu Pathian mit hmuhin tenawm tak a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dân leh zâwlneite thu chu Johana lo awm thleng khân a awm a; chumi achinah chuan Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha hi an hril a, mi tin an lût lui ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, dân thu chhunhan tê tak tê bo ai pawhin, vân leh khawvêl boral a awl zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawh nupui maa, nupui dang nei apiang a uire a ni; tu pawh mi nupui mâk nei apiang a uire a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mi hausa tu emaw a awm a, puan sen duk leh puan zai sîn tak a sin a, ni tin nuamsa takin a awm ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tin, a hming Lazara, kut dawh pakhat, pân bawm khah lûk, a kawngkhâr bulah an muttîr ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi hausa dawhkâna ei nawi tla chu ei a duh a; uite lah chuan a pânte an lo liahsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kut dawh chu a thi a, vântirhkohten an kalpui a, Abrahama ângchhûngah an dah a. Mi hausa pawh chu a thi a, phûmin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mitthi khuaah chuan na tak tuar rêng rêngin a awm a, a han vanvadâk a, hla taka Abrahama, a ângchhûnga Lazara awm nên a hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a au va, ‘Ka pa Abraham, mi khawngaih la, Lazara kha han tîr rawh, a kutzung hmâwr tuiah chiah sela, ka lei tihdaihna tûrin; he mei alhah hian ka na êm êm a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, Abrahama chuan, ‘Ka fapa, nangin i dam lai khân thil ṭha i chang a, chutiang bawkin Lazaran thil ṭha lo a chan kha hre ta che; nimahsela, tûnah ani zawng hetah thlamuang takin a awm a, nang zawng i nâ a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu lo rêngah pawh, heta ṭanga nangni hnêna kal tumte chu an kal theih lohna tûr leh, tu mah khata ṭanga keini hnêna an lo kai theih lohna tûrin, keini leh nangni inkârah hian leikak nasa tak an siam tlat a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, ‘A nih leh ka pa, ani chu ka pa ina kaltîr tûr talin ka ngên a che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />pianpui mipa panga ka nei si a; he ka awmnaah hian an lo kal ve dah ang e, ṭhahnemngai takin hrilh teh se,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abrahama erawh chuan, ‘Mosia leh zâwlneite an nei alâwm; chu mite thu chu ngai rawh se,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, ‘Ka pa Abraham, ni lo ve; mitthi zînga mi meuh an hnênah kal zâwk sela an sim ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘Mosia leh zâwlneite thu an ngaih loh chuan, mitthi zînga mi tho leh mah sela an âwih chuang lo vang,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Tlûknate hi awm lo thei a ni lo; nimahsela, tlûkna awmtîrtu chung chu a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêng mi tête zînga pakhat pawh tihtlûk ai chuan, a titlutu tûr nghâwngah chuan buh râwt sawmna lung awrhtîrin, tuifinriatah thlâk sela, a tân a ṭha zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh u: i unauvin thil a tihsual chuan zilh rawh; a inchhîr chuan ngaidam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni khatah i chungah vawi sarih thil tisualin, vawi sarih, ‘Ka inchhîr e,’ tia i lama a lo hawi leh chuan i ngaidam tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tirhkohte chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Kan rin tiphui deuh vang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Anṭam mu fang khat ang rin in neih chuan, he thingtheihmu kûng hnênah hian, ‘Lo inphawi la, tuifinriatah lo inphun rawh,’ in ti ang a, in thu a âwih mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zîngah tu pawhin lei letin emaw, berâm vêngin emaw bâwih nei ula, a lo sûl hâwn veleh, ‘Chaw rawn kîl nghâl rawh,’ tu nge lo ti ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Ka ei tûr mi siamsak la, puan veng la, ka ei ka bâr zawh hma loh chu ka rawng mi bâwl rawh; chumi hnuah chuan nangin i eiin i bâr ang chu,’ tu nge lo ti zâwk lo vang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In thu anga a tih avângin in bâwih hnênah lâwmthu in hrilh ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni pawhin, in hnêna thupêk zawng zawng anga in tih hnuin, ‘Bâwih ṭhahnem lo kan ni e; kan tih tûr rêng a ni kan tih ni,’ ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Jerusalem khuaa an kal dâwnin, Samari leh Galili ram chu a kal pêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, khaw engah emaw a luh dâwnin, mi, phâr hlîr sâwmin an tâwk a; chu mite chu hla takah an ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tin, aw ring takin, “Isu, Zirtîrtu, min khawngaih rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan anmahni chu a han hmuh chuan an hnênah, “Puithiamte hnênah va inentîr tawh u,” a ti a. Tin, heti hi a ni a, an kal lai chuan an lo thiang ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an zînga pakhat chu a dam ta tih a inhriat veleh, aw ring taka Pathian fak chungin a kîr leh ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, a ke bulah a bawkkhup a, lâwmthu a sawi a; chu mi chu Samari mi a ni nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan a chhâng a, “Mi sâwm kha in lo thiang ta a ni lâwm ni? Pakuate kha khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He awze mi chauh lo hi Pathian fak tûra lo kîr leh an awm na nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Tho la, kal rawh; i rinna hi i dampui a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaiten Pathian ram lo thlen hun tûr an zawh avângin an hnênah, “Pathian ram chu hmuh theihin a lo thleng lo ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘En teh u, heta hi!’ emaw, ‘Sawta saw!’ emaw an ti hek lo vang; ngai teh u, Pathian ram chu in zîngah a awm a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Mihring Fapa dam lai nite hi, ni khat tal hi in hmuh duh nite a la awm ang; nimahsela, in hmu tawh si lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, in hnênah, ‘En teh u, sawta saw!’ ‘En teh u, heta hi!’ an ti ang che u; kal chhuak suh ula, anni chu zui hek suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />vân hnuai lehlama kâwl a phêta, vân hnuai lehlam thlenga a êng ṭhîn ang hian, Mihring Fapa hi a lo kal niin a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi hma chuan thil tam tak a tuar ang a, tûnlai chhuante duh lohvin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nova dam laia thil awmzia ang khân, Mihring Fapa a lo kal leh nite chuan a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nova lawnga a luha, tui a lo lêta, an zaa a tihhlum tâk vek ni kha a thlen hma loh zawng, an eiin an bâr a, nupui pasal an innei ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Lota dam laiin a lo awm; an eiin an bâr a, an leiin an hralh a, an chîngin an sa ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, Sodom khua ata Lota a chhuah ni chuan, vân aṭangin mei leh kât a sûr a, an zain a tihlum ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Mihring Fapa hi a rawn inlâr ni chuan a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan tu pawh a sum in chhûnga awma, amah in chunga awm chu, chuh tûrin chhuk suh se; lova awm chu hâwng bawk suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lota nupui hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tu pawh a nun humhimna zawng apiangin a chân ang a, tu pawh a nun chân apiangin a humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chumi zânah chuan khum pakhatah mi pahnih an awm ang a, pakhat chu kal bopuiin a awm ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmeichhe pahnih buh râwt sawmin an awm ang a, pakhat chu kal bopuiin a awm ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiahin a awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, khawiah maw?” an ti a, an chhâng a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Sa ruang awmna apiangah mulukawlhte pawh an awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, beidawng lovin an ṭawngṭai fo tûr a ni tih hriattîrna tûrin, an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khaw engah emaw rorêltu pakhat a awm a, chu mi chuan Pathian a hlau lo va, mihring lah a ngaihsak hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tin, chumi khuaah chuan hmeithai pakhat a awm a; ani chu, ‘Ka khingpui chungah phuba mi lâksak rawh,’ tiin a hnênah a kal fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan rei fe a duh lo va; nimahsela, nakinah chuan a rilruin, ‘Pathian hlau lovin mihring ngaihsak lo mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />he hmeithai hian mi tihbuai avângin a phuba ka lâksak teh mai ang; chuti lo chuan, a lo kal fo hian mi la tihah hrep dah ang e,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa vêkin, “Rorêltu fel lo thusawi chu hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An chungah zaidawh rih mah sela, a mi thlan, a chhûn a zâna amah kotute phuba chu Pathianin a lâksak lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, an phuba a lâksak thuai ang. Nimahsela, Mihring Fapa hi a lo kal hun chuan, khawvêlah hian rinna a rawn hmu ang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, mi fel tak nih inringa, mi dang zawng zawng hmusit ṭhîn tute emaw hnênah chuan he tehkhin thu pawh hi a sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mi pahnih Pathian biak inah ṭawngṭai tûrin an han kal a; pakhat chu Pharisai a ni a, pakhat chu chhiahkhawntu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharisai chu a ding a, amah chauhvin heti hian a ṭawngṭai a: ‘Pathian, mi dang anga hlêprute, fel lote, uirête ka nih loh avâng leh he chhiahkhawntu ang pawh hi ka nih loh avângin i chungah ka lâwm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chawlhkâr khat apiangah vawi hnih chaw ka nghei ṭhîn a; ka neih apiang sâwmah pakhat ka pe ṭhîn,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhiahkhawntu erawh chu hla takah a ding a, vân lam pawh a dâk ngam lo va, ‘Pathian, kei mi sual hi mi khawngaih rawh,’ tiin a âwm a inchûm a inchûm ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ka hrilh a che u, a hmasa aiin chu mi zâwk chu thiam changin a inah a kal chhuk ta a. Inngaihlu apiang an tlâwm ang a, inngaitlâwm chu chawimawiin an awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, a deh atân a hnênah an nausênte pawh an rawn hruai a; zirtîrte erawh chuan chu chu an hmuh veleh an lo hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan anni chu a ko va, “Naupang tête ka hnênah han kaltîr ula, hnar suh u; Pathian ram chu hetiang mite ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh Pathian ram chu naupang têin a lawm anga lâwm lo apiang a chhûngah an lût tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, hotu tuin emaw a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu ṭha, chatuana nunna chang tûrin engtin nge ka tih ang?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Engati nge ṭha mi tih? Mi pakhat chauh lo chu tu mah ṭha an awm lo, chu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thupêkte chu i hria alâwm - ‘Uirê suh, Tual that suh, Ru suh, Dâwtin hêk suh, I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh,’ tihte hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chûng thu zawng zawng chu ka naupan têt ata ka zâwm zêl ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a hriatin a hnênah, “Tûnah pawh kawng khat i la bâk e; i neih zawng zawng hralh la, pachhiate hnênah sem rawh; chutichuan, vânah ro i nei ang; tin, lo kal la, mi zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan chûng thu chu a hriatin a lungngai ta êm êm a, a hausak êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan amah chu a en a, “Sum ngahte chu Pathian rama luh a va harsa dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi hausa Pathian rama luh aiin, sanghâwngsei hriau benga luh tlang a awl zâwk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, chu thu hriate chuan, “A nih leh, tu nge chhandam ni thei ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Mihring tih rual loh hi Pathian tih theih a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Peteran, “Ngai teh, keinin kan in leh lo kalsanin kan zui ta chia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh Pathian ram avânga in emaw, nupui emaw, unaute emaw, nu leh pa emaw, fate emaw kalsan tawh phawt chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tûn dam chhûng la la hian a aia tam zâwk hmu lo tûr tu mah an awm lo, hun lo la thleng tûra chatuana nunna nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, sâwm leh pahnihte chu a hnênah a hruai hrang a, an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, Jerusalem khuaa kan chhoh dâwn hi; zâwlneite thu ziak zawng zawng kha Mihring Fapa chungah hian a thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentail-te hnênah an pe ang a, nuihza siam nân an hmang ang a, zahthlâk takin an siam ang a, chil an chhâk ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tin, an vua ang a, an tihlum ang; tin, ni thum nîah a tho leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu rêng rêng chu a ngaihna an hre lo va; thusawi chu an lakah thupin a awm a, eng sawi nge a nih pawh an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Jeriko khua a thlen dâwnin, mitdel tu emaw kawng sîrah kutdawhin a lo ṭhu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />chu mi chuan mipui kal thâwm a hria a, eng tizia nge ni ta tih a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan Nazareth Isua a kal a ni tih an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu, “Isu, Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, a hmasate chuan ngawi tûrin an hau va; nimahsela, ani chu, “Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au zual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu a ding a, a hnêna han hruai tûrin thu a pe a; tin, a kiang a lo thlen chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“I chungah engtia ka tih nge i duh?” a ti a, a lo zâwt a. Tin, ani chuan, “Lalpa, hmuh theih ka duh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Hmu thei tawh ang che, i rinna hi i dampui a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, thâwklehkhatan a hmu thei ta nghâl a, Pathian fak chung zêlin amah chu a zui ta a; tin, mi zawng zawng chuan chu chu an hmuhin Pathian an fak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Jeriko khuaah a lût a, a chhûnpelh dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat a hming Zakaia a awm a; chu mi chu chhiahkhawn hotu a ni a, amah pawh a hausa hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu mi eng ang nge a nih hmuh a tum a; mipui avângin, amah lah a tawi si a, a hmu thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, a tlân khalh a, a en tûrin theipui kûngah a lâwn a; chumi kawng chu a rawn zawh tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu chumi hmun a thlen chuan a dâk a, a hnênah, “Zakai, lo chhuk thuai rawh; vawiinah i inah ka thleng tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hmanhmawh takin a chhuk a, hlim takin amah chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chu chu an hmuh veleh an zain, “Mi sual hnêna thleng tûrin a luh tâk saw,” an ti a, an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Zakaia chu a ding a, Lalpa hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, Lalpa, ka sum zâtve pachhiate hnênah ka pe ang a; tin, tu lakah pawh thil eng pawh lo hlêpru ila, a leh liin ka rûl leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isuan Zakaia chung thu a sawi a, “Vawiinah he inah hian chhandamna a lo thleng ta, ani pawh Abrahama fapa a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Boralte zawnga chhandam tûrin Mihring Fapa hi a lo kal a ni rêng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, chûng thûte chu an ngaihthlâk laiin, Jerusalem khua a hnaih tâk avâng leh, Pathian ram lo lang nghâl tûr nia an rin avângin tehkhin thu a sawi tel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, hêng thu hi a sawi a: “Mi ṭha tu emaw ram awpna thu laa lo kîr leh tûrin khaw lam hla takah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kal dâwnin a bâwihte sâwm a ko va, an hnênah rangkachak tangka sâwm a pe a, an hnênah, ‘Ka lo thlen leh hma loh zawng hei hian lo sumdâwng rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, a khuaten an hua a, ‘He mi hi kan lal atân kan duh lo ve,’ ti tûrin a hnungah palai an tlântîr ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ram awpna thu chu a lâka, a lo kîr leh chuan a bâwih, tangka a pêkate chu, an peipun chin hriat nân a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hmasa ber chu a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, i rangkachak tangka kha sâwmin a pung e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘Bâwih ṭha, i ti ṭha e; tlêm te chunga i rinawm avângin khaw sâwm chungah hotuah awm rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a dawttu chu a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, i rangkachak tangka kha pangain a pung e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ani hnênah pawh chuan, ‘Nang pawh khaw panga chungah hotuah awm rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mi dang a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, en teh, hei i rangkachak tangka kha! Thlan hrûkna puanin ka vawng reng a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi vîn tak i nih avângin ka hlau che a ni; i dah loh pawh i la ṭhîn a, i tuh loh pawh i ât ṭhîn si a,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, ‘Bâwih sual, i ṭawngka chhuak ngeiin ka thiam loh vang che. Mi vîn tak ka niha, ka dah loh pawh ka lâk ṭhina, ka tuh loh pawh ka ah ṭhin i hria maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A nih ahnu, engati nge ka tangka hi sumdâwng ina i dah loh? Tichuan, ka hâwnin a pung nên ka ṭhîng tûr a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a kianga dingte hnênah, ‘A rangkachak tangka kha lâksak ula, rangkachak tangka sâwm neitu hnênah pe rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, ‘Ka pu, ani zawngin rangkachak tangka sâwm a nei alâwm,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Ka ti a che u, a nei apiang an pêk belhchhah ang a, a nei lo chu a neih chhun pawh an lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nimahsela, hêng mi dotute, an lal atâna mi duh lote hi, rawn hruai ula, ka hmaah that rawh u,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chutiang thu a sawi zawh chuan Jerusalem khaw lam pan chhovin hma a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Bethphage leh Bethani khaw kiang, Olive tlâng an tih chu, a thlen chuan zirtîrte zînga mi pahnih a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“In hma zâwn khuaah sâwn va kal ta ula; chutah chuan in luh tirhin sabengtungno thlun, tu ma la chuan ngai lohna in va hmu ang; chu chu phelh ula, han kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, tu pawhin, ‘Engah nge in phelh?’ tia an zawh che u chuan, heti hian sawi ang che u, ‘Lalpan a duh a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a tirhte chu an kal ta a, an hnêna a sawi ang ngeiin an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, sabengtungno chu an phelh lai chuan a neituten an hnênah, “Sabengtungno kha engah nge in phelh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Lalpan a duh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua hnênah an rawn kai ta a; tin, sabengtungno chungah chuan an puante an phah a, a chungah Isua an chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, a kalna tûr kawngah chuan an puante an phah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, an thlen dâwn hnaihin, Olive tlâng liam dâwnah chuan, zirtîr mipui zawng zawng chu a thilmak tih zawng zawng an hmuh avângin an lâwm a, aw ring takin, “Lalpa hminga Lal lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se, vânah rem thu lêng sela, chungnung berah khian ropuina awm rawh se!” tiin Pathian an fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, mipui zînga Pharisai ṭhenkhatin a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, i zirtîrte hi zilh rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Ka hrilh a che u, hêngte hi an ngawih reng chuan lungte tal an au chhuak tûr a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, a thlen dâwn ruaiin khua chu a hmu ta a, a ṭah chhan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Aw, nang lul hian tûn chhûng hian thlamuanna tûr thu hi lo hre teh hrâm la! Nimahsela, tûnah zawng i hmuh loh nân a inthup tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />I râlten i vêlin lei kulh an siam ang a, an hual ang chia, i vêlin chhuah theih lohvin an awm chhan ang chia, i chhûnga i fanaute, nangmah nên leiah an paih vak ang che, i chhûnga lung intiang rêng rêng an zuah lo vang; an fan lai che i hriat loh avângin chutiang nite chu i chungah a lo la thleng ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak inah chuan a va lût a, englo zuartute chu a hnawt chhuak ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />an hnênah, “ ‘Ka in chu ṭawngṭaina in a ni ang,’ tih ziak a ni; nangni erawh chuan suamhmangte pûkah in siam zâwk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, ni tin Pathian biak inah chuan a zirtîr ṭhîn a. Tin, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute leh vântlâng zînga hotu deuhte chuan amah tihboral an tum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />nimahsela, miten a thu an ngaihthlâk kham theih loh avângin, a tih dân tûr an hre thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni khat chu heti hi a ni a, Pathian biak inah mite a zirtîra, Chanchin Ṭha a hril laiin, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute chu, upate nên a hnênah an lo kal thut a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, a hnênah, “Tu thuin nge hêng thil hi i tih? Tuin nge thu pe che? Min hrilh rawh,” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin thu kam khat ka zâwt ve ang che u; mi hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johana baptisma kha vâna mi thu nge mihring thu?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, an inngaihtuah a, “ ‘Vâna mi thu,’ kan tih chuan, ‘Engah nge a thu in âwih loh?’ min ti si ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ‘Mihring thu,’ kan tih chuan mi zawng zawngin lungin min dêng ang; Johana chu zâwlnei a nih an ring si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, an chhâng a, “Khawi lam zâwk thu nge ni kan hre lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh bîk lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, vântlâng hnênah he tehkhin thu hi a sawi ta a: “Tuin emaw grêp huan a siam a, lo enkawltute hnênah thlawh hlawh tûrin a pe a, rei tak thang tûrin ram dangah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a lawh hun chuan, huana rah chu a chan ai an lo pêk tûrin, lo enkawltute hnênah chuan bâwih pakhat a tîr a; nimahsela, lo enkawltute chuan an lo vêl a, kutruakin an kaltîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, bâwih dang a tîr leh a; chu pawh chu an lo vêl leh bawk a, zahthlâk takin an siam a, kutruak vêkin an kaltîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a pathumna a tîr leh pek a; chu mi pawh chu an lo tisil a, an paih chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, grêp huan neitupa chuan, ‘Engtin nge ka tih ang aw? Ka fapa duh tak ka tîr mai ang, ani hi an lo zah mahna,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, lo enkawltute chuan ani chu an lo hmuh veleh, ‘He mi hi roluahtu tûr chu a ni; i that ang u; chutichuan, a ro chu kan tân a ni ang,’ tiin an inrâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, grêp huan ata chu an theh chhuak a, an tihlum ta a. Chutichuan, grêp huan neitupa chuan an chungah engtin nge a rawn tih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo enkawltute chu a rawn tiboral ang a, huan chu mi dangte a pe ang,” a ti a. Tin, chu chu an hriatin, “Chûng êm chu thleng suh se!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan anniho chu a en a, “He thu an ziak hi eng nge ni le? ‘In satute lung duh loh kha, Chu ngei chu a kila lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni ta,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawh chumi lung chunga tlu apiang an keh sawm ang; a delh lek phei chu a râwt dip ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai tak chuan lehkhaziaktute leh puithiam lalten man an tum a; nimahsela, mipui chu an hlau va; chu tehkhin thu chu anmahni demin a sawi tih an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, amah chu ram awptu rorêlna leh thuneihnaa thlen atân, a thusawi sual la tûrin an châng reng a, enthlatu, mi ṭha anga awm derte chu an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, dik takin thu i sawiin i zirtîr a, tu mah thlei bîk lovin tihtak zetin Pathian kawng thu i zirtîr ṭhîn tih kan hria e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kaisara hnêna chhiah kan chawi a thiang nge thiang lo?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan an ngamthlêm a ni tih a hria a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />an hnênah, “Duli mi entîr rawh u,” a ti a. “Tu lem leh tu hming nge chuang hi?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Kaisara,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “A nih ahnu, Kaisara thilte chu Kaisara hnênah pe ula, Pathian thilte chu Pathian hnênah pe ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui hmaa a thu sawi sual lâk tûr an hmu lo va; a chhânna chu mak an ti hle a, an ngawi reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Saddukai, thawhlehna a awm lo tite zînga mi tute emaw a hnênah an lo kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, Mosian, ‘Tu pawh a unaupain nupui nei sela, fa nei lovin thi sela, a unaupain a nupui rochungin, a unaupa tân chi a thlahsak tûr a ni,’ tih min ziaksak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw le, sal sarih an awm a; a upa berin nupui a nei a, fa nei lovin a thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A pahnihna chuan a rochung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a pathumna chuan a rochung leh a; chutiang ṭheuhvin pasarihte chu fa nei lovin an thi zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan hmeichhia pawh chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, thawhleh hunah chuan a tu bera nupui nge ni ang? An pasarih chuan nupuiah an nei ṭheuh si a,” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “He khawvêl mite hi nupui pasal an innei ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />nimahsela, chûng huna tel tlâkah leh mitthi zîng ata thawhlehnaa tel tlâka ruat apiangte chu nupui pasal an innei dâwn tawh lo ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />thih pawh an thi leh thei dâwn tawh lo a ni, vântirhkohte tlukin an awm dâwn si a; thawhlehna fate an nih avângin Pathian fate an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mitthi kaihthawha an awm tûr thu, Mosia pawhin Hnim buk thûah Lalpa chu, ‘Abrahama Pathian, Isaaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian,’ a tih lai khân a hriattîr kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ani chu mitthi Pathian a ni lo va, mi nung Pathian a ni zâwk e; ani ngaih chuan mi zawng zawng an nung vek si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lehkhaziaktu tuten emaw, “Zirtîrtu, i sawi dik zet mai,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thu dang an zâwt ngam tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Krista chu Davida fapa a ni tih engtiziaa sawi ṭhîn nge an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Fakna Hla Buah Davida ngeiin, ‘Lalpa chuan ka Lalpa hnênah, I hmêlmate i ke nghahchhana ka siam hma loh zawng Ka ding lamah ṭhu rawh, a ti,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chutichuan, Davidan ani chu ‘Lalpa’ a ti si a, engtin nge a fapa a nih theih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng hriatin a zirtîrte hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Lehkhaziaktute lakah fîmkhur rawh u; anni chuan kawrfual haa lên an duh ṭhîn a, dâwr hmunah chibai bûkte, inkhâwmna inah ṭhutphah ṭha berte, ruaiṭhehnaah hmun ṭha berte an ngaina ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hmeithai sum an ei a, tlâng bum nân rei tak an ṭawngṭai ṭhîn; chûngho chuan thiam loh an chang nasa lehzual ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a dâk chhuak a, mi hausaten thawhlâwm bâwma an thawhlâwm thlâk lai a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hmeithai rethei tê tu emaw dâr tangka dere pahnih rawn thlâk a hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, “Tihtak zetin ka hrilh a che u. Hêng zawng zawng ai hian he hmeithai rethei tê hian a thlâk tam zâwk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hêng zawng zawng hian an neih liama mi thawhlâwmah an thlâk a ni; ani erawh hi chuan a duh lai tak, a intunnunna tûra a neih chhun tê a thlâk vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tuten emaw Pathian biak in thu, lung ṭha tak leh thilpêk khâwma an chei mawizia chu an sawi laiin, ani chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hêng in thil hmuh hi, tihchim loh va lung intiang rêng rêng hetah a awm lo vang; chutiang ni chu a la thleng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, chûng chu eng tikah nge a lo awm ang le? Chûng chu a lo thlen dâwn hunah chhinchhiahna eng nge awm ang?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “An tihder loh nân che u fîmkhur rawh u. Mi tam tak, ‘Krista chu ka ni,’ ‘A hun a thleng dâwn ta e,’ tiin keima hming chhâlin an lo kal ang; chu mite chu zui suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, indo thu leh buai thu in hriat hunin hlau suh ang che u; chûng chu a thleng hmasa tûr rêng a ni, tâwpna erawh chu a thleng nghâl rih lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Hnam hrang leh hnam hrang an indo vang a, ram hrang leh ram hrang an indo vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />lîr nasa takin a nghîng a nghîng ang a; hmun hrang hrangah ṭâmte a tla ang a, hrite a lêng bawk ang a; vân aṭangin thil hlauhawmte leh chhinchhiahna nasa takte a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thil zawng zawng thlen hma chuan an man ang che u a, inkhâwmna inah leh tân inah hruaiin an tiduhdah ang che u a, keima hming avângin lalte leh hotute hmaah an hruai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In thiam channa a la ni hlei hlei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, chhânna tûr ngaihtuah lâwk lo tûrin in rilruah intinghet rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />in hmêlma zawng zawngin an dodâla an hnial theih lohna tûr kâ leh finna ka pe dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, in nu leh in pate, in unaute, in laichînte, in ṭhiante pawhin an mantîr ang che u; a ṭhen an tihhlumtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima hming avângin mi zawng zawng huat in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, in samzai khat pawh a boral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In chhelin in nun in chhanhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, sipaihoten Jerusalem khua an hual in hmuh hunah, a boral dâwn tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Judai rama awmte chu tlângahte tlân bo rawh se; a chhûnga awmte chuan chhuahsan rawh se; rama awmte chu a chhûngah lût suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng ni chu phuba lâk ni a ni e, thu an ziak zawng zawng a lo thlen theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng nîah chuan raite leh nau no pawmte chung a pik ang, khawvêlah hian hrehawm nasa tak a thlen dâwn avâng leh, he chite chungah hian thinurna a thlen dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, khandaihah an thi ang a, hnam tin hnênah sala hruaiin an awm ang; tin, Jentail-te ni a kin hma loh zawng Jerusalem khua chu Jentail-te rah behin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, nîah te, thlaah te, arsiah te chhinchhiahna a awm ang a; tuifinriat rûm leh a fâwn avângin, leiah pawh hnam tin hrehawmna leh manganna a thleng ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />thlabâr avâng leh khawvêla thil lo thleng tûr chu ngaihtuah avângin mite an thidang ang; vân thiltihtheihnate chu a nghîng dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Mihring Fapa hi, thiltihtheihna leh ropuina nasa tak nên, chhûm zînga lo kal an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chûng thil chu a lo thlen tirhin, en chho ula, dâk chhuak rawh u; in tlanna tûr chu a hnaih tâk avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi a: “Theipui kûng leh thing zawng zawng en rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a chawrno veleh chu chu in hmu a, nipui a lo thaw dâwn tih mahniin in hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni pawhin chûng chu a lo thleng in hmuh hun chuan, Pathian ram a lo hnai tawh tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, thil zawng zawng a thlen kim hma loh zawng tûnlai chhuante hi an ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lei leh vân a ral ang a, ka thu erawh chu a ral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, fîmkhur rawh u; chuti lo chuan, ei puar lutuk nên, zu ruih nên, dam chhûng khawsak ngaihtuah nên, in rilru a khat lutuk hlauh ang a, chumi ni chuan thang âwk angin thâwklehkhatan in chungah a lo thleng phut ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutiang tak chuan lei chung zawng zawnga awmte chungah chuan a thleng ṭheuh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, chûng thil lo thleng tûr zawng zawng chu pumpelh tlâkah leh Mihring Fapa hmaa ding tlâka ruat in nih theihna tûrin, eng lai pawhin ṭawngṭai chungin ngaihven rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, ni tin Pathian biak inah a zirtîr ṭhîn a; zan tin a chhuak a, Olive tlâng an tihah chuan a riak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, zîngah a thu ngaithla tûrin mi zawng zawng Pathian biak inah a hnênah an lo kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chhang dawidim telh loh kût, Kalhlên Kût an tih chu, a hnai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lal leh lehkhaziaktute chuan a tihhlumna zia an zawng a, vântlâng an hlau si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, sâwm leh pahnihte zînga tel, Juda Iskariota an tiha chhûngah chuan Setana a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu a va kal a, an hnêna a mantîr theihna tûrzia puithiam lalte leh hotute chu a va râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, anni chu an lâwm hle a, a hnênah tangka pêk an tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a remti a, mipui awm loh hlâna mantîrna remchâng a zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chhang dawidim telh loh ni, Kalhlên Kût, berâmno talhna tûr ni chu a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan Petera leh Johana chu, “Kalhlên kût chaw kan ei tûrin min va buatsaihsak rawh u,” tiin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Khawiah nge va buatsaih ila i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, khawpuia in luhin, mipa, bêla tui puin a tâwk ang che u a; a luhna inah zui lût ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, in neitupa hnênah chuan, ‘Zirtîrtuin, ka zirtîrteho nên Kalhlên Kût chaw kan eina tûr, mikhual pindan chu khawiah nge? a ti a che,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan pindan chungnung zau tak, bungraw awm sa, a entîr ang che u; chutah chuan buatsaih ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, an kal ta a, an hnêna a sawi ang takin an hmu a; tin, Kalhlên Kût chaw chu an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a ei a lo hun chuan ani chuan chaw a kîl a, tirhkohte chuan an kîlpui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Ka thil tuar hmain he Kalhlên Kût chaw hi eipui che u ka duh êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, hei hi Pathian rama a tak tak a nih hma loh zawng, ka ei leh tawh dâwn lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, no a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin, “Hei hi la ula, insem rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ka hrilh a che u, tûn achinah Pathian ram a lo thlen hma loh zawng, grêp hrui rah tui hi ka in leh tawh dâwn lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chhang a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a phel a, an hnênah a pe a, “Hei hi ka taksa, in aia pêk tûra chu a ni; mi hriat reng nân hei hi ti ṭhîn rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, zanriah ei zawhin chutiang bawkin no chu a la a, “He no hi ka thisena thuthlung thar chu a ni, in aia chhuak tûra chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, ngai teh u, mi mantîrtu tûra kut chu ka hnênah dawhkân chungah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi an ruat angin a kal dâwn a ni; nimahsela, a mantîrtu tûr mihring chung chu a pik e!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, annin, “Kan zîngah chutiang thil ti tûr chu tu nge ni ang le?” tiin an inzâwt ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, an zîngah tu ber nge ropui bera a ruat tih thûah inhnialna a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Jentailho lalte chu an chungah an lal ṭhîn a; an chunga thuneitute chu, ‘Nu leh pa,’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zawng chutiang in ni lo vang; in zînga ropui ber chu nau zâwk angin awm sela, lal ber chu rawngbâwltu angin awm zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu nge ropui zâwk, chaw kîltu nge rawngbâwltu? Chaw kîltu a ni lo vem ni? Nimahsela, kei zawng in zîngah rawngbâwltu angin ka awm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlêmna ka tawh chhûng zawng nangni mi awmpuitu in ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tichuan, ka rama ka dawhkâna in eia in bâr theihna tûrin, ka Pain ram mi ruatsak angin ram ka ruatsak che u a ni; tichuan, Israel hnam sâwm leh hnam hnih rorêlsakin lalṭhutphahah in la ṭhu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Simon, Simon, ngai teh, Setanan buh thlei anga a thlei theihna tûr che uin, nangniho hi a dîl che u asin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />nimahsela, i rin a bo loh nân ka ṭawngṭaisak che a ni; i hawi kîr leh hunah nangin i unaute tinghet ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, i hnênah chuan tân inah leh thihnaah pawh kal ve ka huam asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Peter, ka hrilh a che, vawi thum mi phat hma loh zawng vawiinah hian âr a khuang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Tangka ip lova, iptê lova, pheikhawk lova ka tirh chhuah che u khân thil rêng rêng in tlachham em?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Chham lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tûnah erawh chuan tu pawh tangka ip nei chuan keng rawh se, iptê nên; tu pawh khandaih nei lo chuan a puan hralh sela, lei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, ‘Ani chu mi sual zîngah an chhiar tel ta,’ tih ziak kha ka chungah a lo thleng tûr a ni; ka chungchâng thûte kha a thleng zo dâwn ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Lalpa, en teh, hei khandaih pahnih a awm,” an ti a. Ani chuan an hnênah, “A tâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a chhuak a, a dân pângngaiin Olive tlângah chuan a kal ta a; zirtîrte pawhin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a hmun chu a va thlen chuan an hnênah, “Thlêmnaa in luh loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, lung den phâk chinah emaw a va kal hrang ta a; tin, a ṭhingṭhi a, a ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Ka Pa, rem i tih chuan he no hi ka hnên ata la sawn rawh; nimahsela, keia thu ni lovin, nangma thû thû ni zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, vân aṭangin vântirhkoh pakhat, a tiharh tûrin a hnênah a rawn inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, a thlaphâng êm êm a, ṭhahnemngai lehzualin a ṭawngṭai a; a thlan chu thi far lian tak angin leiah a far a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, a ṭawngṭai zawha a thawhin zirtîrte hnênah chuan a lo kal a, an lungngaih avânga an lo muhîl a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />tin, an hnênah, “Engati nge in muthilh? Thlêmnaa in luh loh nân tho ula, ṭawngṭai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, a la sawi lai mêkin, ngai teh, mipui an lo kal a, sâwm leh pahnihte zînga tel Juda an tih chuan an hma a rawn hruai a; tin, fawh tumin Isua a rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isua chuan a hnênah, “Juda, Mihring Fapa hi fâwpin i mantîr dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, a vêla mite chuan thil lo thleng tûr chu an hriatin, “Lalpa, khandaihin kan sât ang em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, an zînga tuin emaw puithiam lalber bâwih chu a sât a, a beng ding lam a sah thlâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “A tâwk e,” a ti a. Tin, a beng chu a dek a, a tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnêna lo kal puithiam lalte, Pathian biak in hotute leh upate hnênah chuan, “Khandaihte, talhtumte kengin, suamhmang man tûr ang rengin in lo chhuak a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Pathian biak ina in hnêna ni tin ka awm laite khân, mi man tumin mi ban si lo va; nimahsela, tûn hi in chêt hun a ni e, thim thuneihna nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, an man a, an hruai a, puithiam lalber inah chuan an hruai lût ta a. Tin, Peteran hla tak aṭangin a zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, in hual chhûng kawtlaiah mei an chhêm a, an ṭhu khâwm a, Petera chu an zîngah a va ṭhu ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, mei ênga a ṭhut laiin nula tuin emaw a hmu a, a melh reng a, “He mi pawh hi a hnêna awm kha a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Hmeichhia, ani chu ka hre lo ve,” tiin a pha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tin, nakin deuhvah mi dangin a rawn hmu leh a, “Nang pawh an zînga mi i nih hi,” a ti a. Petera erawh chuan, “Mihring, ka ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tin, dârkâr khat lai chinah chuan mi dangin, “He mi pawh hi a hnêna awm kha a ni ngei mai; Galili rama mi a ni alâwm,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tin, Peteran, “Mihring, i thusawi chu ka hre lo ve,” a ti a. Tin, thâwklehkhatan, a ṭawng lai tak chuan âr a khuang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu a hawi a, Petera chu a en a. Tin, Petera chuan Lalpan, “Vawiinah hian âr a khuan hmain vawi thum mi phat ang,” a hnênah a tih thu kha a lo hre chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tin, a chhuak a, a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a chelhtuten nuihza siam nân an hmang a, an vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tin, a mit an tuam a, “Sawi rawh, tu nge vua che?” tiin an zâwt ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tin, thu dang tam tak pawhin an sawichhiain an hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tin, khawvâr veleh vântlâng upaho, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute chu an rawn inkhâwm a, an rorêlnaah chuan an hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />“Krista i nih zet chuan min hrilh rawh,” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Hrilh che u mah ila in âwih lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />zâwt che u mah ila in chhâng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûn achinah chuan Mihring Fapa hi Pathian thiltihtheihna ding lamah a ṭhu tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tin, an zain, “Nang hi Pathian Fapa chu i ni em ni le?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Eng hriatna dang nge kan ngaih tawh ang? Keimahni ngeiin ama ka chhuak kan hre tawh alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chu an tho va, Isua chu Pilata hnênah an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, “He mi hian kan chite a tikhawlo va, Kaisara hnênah chhiah chawi a khap a, Krista, lal, a intih kan hria e,” tiin an hêk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan a hnênah, “Juda-te lal i ni em?” tiin a zâwt a. Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Ni e,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan puithiam lalte leh mipuite hnênah chuan, “He mi chungah hian eng mah sual ka hmu lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan, “Galili ramah a ṭan a, hemi hmun thleng hian, Judai ram khaw tinah zirtîrin mi zawng zawng a chawk hnawk ṭhîn a ni,” tiin an bei lehzual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan chu chu a hriatin, chu mi chu Galili rama mi a nih leh nih loh a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Heroda biala mi a ni tih a hriat veleh Heroda hnênah a tîr ta a; chûng lai chuan ani pawh chu Jerusalem khuaah a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Herodan Isua a hmuh chuan a lâwm êm êm a; a chanchin a hriat avângin, hmân ata tawh hmuh a duh hle rêng a, a thilmak tih eng emaw tal hmuh pawh a beisei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, thu tam tak a zâwt a; nimahsela, a eng mah chu a chhâng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh lehkhaziaktute chuan dingin nasa takin an hêk chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Heroda leh a sipaite chuan Isua an hmusit a, nuihza siam nân an hmang a; tin, puan ropui tak sintîrin Pilata hnênah a tîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni tak chuan Heroda leh Pilata chu an inngeih ta a; chumi hma zawng chuan an intai ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan puithiam lalte, hotute, mi zawng zawngte a ko khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an hnênah, “ ‘Mite a tikhawlo,’ tiin he mi hi ka hnênah in rawn hruai kha a ni a; tin, ngai rawh u, in hmaah ka chhuahchhâl a, in hêkna thûah khân he mi chungah hian eng mah sual ka hmu lo a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Heroda pawhin a hmu hek lo; kan hnênah a rawn tîr leh ta mai a nih hi; ngai rawh u, thihna khawp meuhvin eng mah a ti lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka vêl ang a, ka chhuah mai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, rual takin an au va, “He mi hi chu tiboral la, Barabba kha min chhuahsak zâwk rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Chu mi chu khawpuia helna eng emaw avâng leh, tual a thah avânga tân ina tâng a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilata erawh chuan Isua chu chhuah a duh a, an hnênah thu a sawi leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, an au va, “Kraws-ah khêngbet rawh, kraws-ah khêngbet rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a vawi thumnaah an hnênah, “Engah maw? He mi hian eng nge a tihsual ni? Thihna khawp meuh a chungah eng mah ka hmu lo; chutichuan, ka vêl ang a, ka chhuah mai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni erawh chuan aw ring takin kraws-a khêngbet tûrin an ngên lui hrâm a. Tin, an aw chuan a vau dai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chuan an ngen anga ti tûrin thu a titlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Helna leh tualthah avânga tân ina tâng an dîl kha a chhuah a; Isua erawh chu an duh duha tihah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, an hruai bo laiin Simona, Kurini khuaa mi, ram lam ata lo kal an man a, Isua hnung lama pu tûrin a chungah kraws chu an nghat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, mi narân leh hmeichhia, âwm chûma ṭap ṭap, mipui tam takin an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan an lam a hawi a, “Jerusalem fanute u, min ṭah suh u, nangmahni leh in fate tân ṭap rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ngai teh u, a ni a lo la thleng ang, chûng nîah chuan, ‘Hmeichhe chingte, nau pai ngai lohna pumte, nau hnêk ngai loh hnutête chu a eng a thâwl e,’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan miten tlâng hnênahte, ‘Min delh rawh,’ an la ti ang a; mual hnênahte, ‘Min khuh rawh,’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thing hring maha hetiang an tih chuan, a rovah chuan eng ti takin ti ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah mi dang pahnih, mi sual, tihhlum tûrin an hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, ‘Lu ruh’ an tih hmun chu an thlenin, chutah chuan kraws-ah an khêngbet a, mi sualte nên, a ding lamah pakhat, a vei lamah pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Ka Pa, anni hi ngaidam rawh; an thiltih hi an hre lo a nih hi,” a ti a. Tin, a silhfênte chu an insemin ṭhum an vâwr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, vântlângho chuan dingin an thlîr a. Tin, hotute pawhin, “Mi dang mah a tidam ṭhîn alâwm; Pathian thlan Krista a nih tak zet chuan amah pawh intidam ang hmiang,” tiin an tiel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, sipaite pawhin amah chu nuihza siam nân an hmang a, a hnênah an lo kal a, zu thûr an pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Juda-te lal i nih zet chuan, intidam rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, a chung lamah chuan, “He Mi hi Juda-te Lal a ni,” tiin lehkha a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, an mi sual khai pakhat chuan Isua a hau va, “Krista chu i ni lo vem ni? Intidam la, keini pawh min tidam ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, pakhat chuan chhân pahin a zilhhau va, “Pathian meuh pawh i hlau na nge? Thuhmun rengin an hrem che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keini zawng hrem zia rêng kan ni; kan thiltih man chauh hmu kan nih hi; he mi hi zawngin eng mah a tisual si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, “Isu, i ram i thlen hunah mi hre reng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, vawiinah hian ka hnênah Paradis-ah i awm ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, chawfâk hun lai a lo ni a, chumi achin behliang mun hun thlengin khawvêl a lo thim ta vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />ni êng a reh ta a; tin, Pathian biak in puanzâr chu a laiah a lo thlêr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Isua aw ring takin a au va, “Ka Pa, i kutah ka thlarau ka kawltîr e,” a ti a. Tin, chu chu a tih zawhin a thlarau a thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, sipai za hotu chuan thil awmzia chu a hmuhin, “He mi hi mathei lovin mi fel tak a ni phawt mai,” tiin Pathian a fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, chu ennawm chu thlîr tûra mipui rawn inkhâwm zawng zawngte chuan, thil awmziate chu an hmuhin, an âwmte chûm chûmin an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, a hmêlhriatte zawng zawng leh hmeichhia, Galili ram aṭanga rawn zuitute chu, chûng thil chu thlîrin hla takah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, mi pakhat a hming Josefa, rorêltu, mi ṭha tak, fel tak a awm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />(an rorêl leh an thiltih pawh kha a remti lo rêng a ni) Juda-te khua Arimathai-a mi a ni a, Pathian ram a beisei ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chu mi chu Pilata hnênah a kal a, Isua ruang a dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, a la thla a, puan zai sînin a tuam a, thlân, lung ker kuak, tu mah la zalh ngai lohnaah a zalh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chu Inrinni a ni a, Chawlhni a ni lek lek tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia, Galili ram aṭanga a hnêna lo kalte khân an zui zêl a, thlân leh a ruang zalh zia chu an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, an haw leh a, englo rimtuite leh hriak rimtuite an siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Chawlhni chuan thupêk angin an châwl ta a; ni sarih ni hmasa berah erawh chuan vârṭianah, englo rimtui an siamte chu kengin thlânah chuan an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, thlân ata lung chu lum sawnin an hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tin, an lût a, Lal Isua ruang chu an hmu si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng avânga an mangan lai chuan ngai teh, mi pahnih, puan mi ên khalh thei sin an kiangah an lo ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, an hlauhva an hmaia lei an sîk laiin anni chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge mitthi zînga mi nung in zawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hetah a awm tawh lo ve, a tho leh ta; Galili rama a awm laia in hnêna a thusawi kha hre leh rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Mihring Fapa hi mi sualte kuta mantîrin a awm ang a, kraws-ah an khêngbet ang a, ni thum nîah a tho leh tûr a ni,’ a tih kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a thu chu an lo hre leh ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thlân ata chu an haw leh a, sâwm leh pakhatte leh mi dang zawng zawngte hnênah chuan chûng thil zawng zawng chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />(Chûng hmeichhiate chu Magdalini Mari te, Joani te, Jakoba nu Mari te an ni a; an hnêna hmeichhe dangte pawhin tirhkohte hnênah chuan chûng thu chu an hrilh bawk a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thu chu thu mai maiah an ruat a, an âwihsak lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Petera chu a tho va, thlân lamah chuan a tlân ta a; tin, a kûn a, a bih a, puan zai sîn awmte chauh chu a hmu a; tichuan, thil awmzia chu mak ti takin a in lamah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, chumi ni tak chuan an zînga mi pahnih chu, khaw pakhat Emmau an tihah an kal dâwn a, chumi khua chu Jerusalem khua aṭangin fîng sawmruk a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, thil lo thleng zawng zawng chu an sawi dûn zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, an sawia an inhnial lai chuan Isua ngeiin a rawn pan a, an hnênah a kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, amah chu an hriat theih loh nân, an mit chu tihvaihin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Kal paha in sawi dun kha eng thu nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, ngui takin an ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a hming Kleopa zâwkin a hnênah, “Jerusalem khuaah nangmah chauhvin em ni i chên, tûnlaia thil awmzia hi i hriat loh ni?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Eng thil maw?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Nazareth Isua, Pathian leh mi zawng zawng mit hmuha a thûah leh a thiltiha zâwlnei hmingthang tak chanchin thu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />puithiam lalte leh kan hotuten thah thu pêk tûrin an hruaia, kraws-a an khenbeh zia thute pawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keinin Israel-te tlantu tûr kha a nih kan beisei tehlul nên. Eng pawh ni sela, chûng thil thlenna chin chu vawiin nên ni thum a ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng lo pawh chu kan pâwlte hmeichhia tute emaw, zîngah a thlânah an va kal a, min rawn timangang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a ruang hmu si lovin, ‘Pathian vântirhkohte inlâr kan hmu a, chu mite chuan a nung leh tih an sawi e,’ an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, kan awmpui zînga tute emaw thlânah chuan an kal a, hmeichhiate sawi ang ngeiin an hmu a; nimahsela, amah chu an hmu si lo va,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi âte u, zâwlneite thusawi zawng zawng âwih kawnga ngawngte u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kristan chûng thil chu tuarin a ropuinaah a lût tûr a ni rêng lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Mosia leh zâwlneite zawng zawng lehkhaah a ṭan a, Pathian Lehkha zawng zawnga ama chanchin ziak apiang chu anmahni a hrilhfiah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an kalna tûr khua chu an thleng dâwn ta a; tin, ani chu hla deuhva kal tum angin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, kâin an chelh a, “Kan hnênah awm ta che; khua a tlai dâwn ta a, ni pawh a tlâk dâwn tawh hi,” an ti a. Tichuan, an hnêna awm tûrin a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, an hnênah chaw kîla a ṭhutin chhang a la a, mal a sâwm a, a phel a, an hnênah a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, an mit a lo vâr a, a hmêl an lo hre ta a; tin, ani chu a ral ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan, “Kalkawnga min biak laia Pathian Lehkha Thute min hrilhfiah lai khân, kan thinlung a harh huai rêng lâwm ni kha?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, chumi lai tak chuan an tho va, Jerusalem khuaah an kîr leh a, sâwm leh pakhatte leh an ṭhiante awm khâwm chu an hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Lalpa chu a lo tho leh tak zet a ni, Simona hnênah pawh a inlâr ta,” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, anni pawhin kalkawnga thil lo thleng leh, chhang a phela, a hmêl an lo hriat tâkziate chu an hrilh ve bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu an sawi laiin amah ngei chu an zîngah a lo ding a, an hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nimahsela, râpthlâk an ti êm êm a, an hlau va, thlarau hmu-ah an inruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge in mangan? Engah nge in rilruah rinhlelhna a lo awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka kutte, ka kephahte hi en rawh u, hei keimah ngei kha ka nih hi! Mi dek ula, en rawh u; mi hmuh ang hian thlarauvin tisa leh ruh a nei lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, chu chu a sawi zawhin a kutte, a kephahte chu an hnênah a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, an lâwm luattuk avânga an la âwih loh cheuva mak an tih chhûngin an hnênah, “Hetah englo ei tûr in nei em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, sangha rawh hrang khat an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a la a, an hmaah chuan a ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Hêng hi ka thu kha a ni, Mosia Dânahte, Zâwlnei Lehkhabuahte, Fakna Hla Buahte, ka chanchin ziak apiang a lo thlen tûrzia in hnêna ka awm laia ka hrilh ṭhin che u kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian Lehkha Thu hriat nân an thinlung a tifing ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />tin, an hnênah, “Hetiangin ziak a ni, ‘Krista chuan hrehawm a tuar ang a, ni thum nîah mitthi zîng ata a tho leh ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />ama hmingin simna thu leh sual ngaihhnathiamna thu Jerusalem khuaa ṭanin, hnam tin hnênah an hril ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chûng thil zawng zawng chu a hretu in ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh u, ka Pa thil tiam chu in chungah ka rawn tîr dâwn e; nimahsela, chung lam ata thiltihtheihnaa an thuam hma loh che u zawng, khawpuiah hian awm reng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Bethani dai kiang thlengin anni chu a hruai chhuak a; tin, a bân a phar a, mal a sâwmsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, mal a sâwmsak lai takin anni chu a ṭhen a, vâna hruai chhohvin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, chibai an bûk a, lâwm êm êmin Jerusalem khuaah an kîr leh ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />tin, Pathian biak inah chuan Pathian fakin an awm fo ṭhîn a.
  </para>
</usx>
